<node id="Nevin Martell">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Nevin Martell is the author of the book \"Beck The Art of Mutation\".", "chunk_id": "57f89dc3a18cfd92", "doc_id": "hp_02b0abd7864c108e"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "According to Nevin Martell's Beck The Art of Mutation (page 13), the initial release was \"limited to one thousand cassette copies\" and \"Sonic Enemy pressed several additional runs until 1995.\"", "chunk_id": "57f89dc3a18cfd92", "doc_id": "hp_02b0abd7864c108e"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_02b0abd7864c108e"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
