<node id="B'z">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "B'z is a Japanese rock duo.", "chunk_id": "2b3a5af8f817eb3b", "doc_id": "hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c"}, {"text": "A band associated with Koshi Inaba.", "chunk_id": "6570bd376c908cac", "doc_id": "hp_9699bc0b1e483dfd"}, {"text": "A Japanese rock duo.", "chunk_id": "383c3a7435cb0e94", "doc_id": "hp_cee234b408138273"}, {"text": "B'z is a band that Koshi Inaba is famous for being a part of.", "chunk_id": "ca46c02b980db182", "doc_id": "hp_e2dc91ec138a82f9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Epic Day is the nineteenth studio album by the Japanese rock duo B'z.", "chunk_id": "2b3a5af8f817eb3b", "doc_id": "hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c"}, {"text": "Joshua has also toured with Koshi Inaba of B'z and blues artist Beth Hart.", "chunk_id": "6570bd376c908cac", "doc_id": "hp_9699bc0b1e483dfd"}, {"text": "B'z (ビーズ , Bīzu ) is a Japanese rock duo, consisting of guitarist, composer and producer Takahiro \"Tak\" Matsumoto (松本 孝弘 , Matsumoto Takahiro ) and vocalist and lyricist Koshi Inaba (稲葉 浩志 , Inaba Kōshi ) , known for their energetic hard-rock tracks and pop ballads.", "chunk_id": "383c3a7435cb0e94", "doc_id": "hp_cee234b408138273"}, {"text": "Singing Bird is the fifth solo studio album by Japanese singer Koshi Inaba, of B'z fame.", "chunk_id": "ca46c02b980db182", "doc_id": "hp_e2dc91ec138a82f9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c", "hp_9699bc0b1e483dfd", "hp_cee234b408138273", "hp_e2dc91ec138a82f9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="C'mon">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "C'mon is the previous studio effort by B'z.", "chunk_id": "2b3a5af8f817eb3b", "doc_id": "hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It was released on March 4, 2015, more than 3.5 years after their previous studio effort, \"C'mon\", their longest gap between studio albums.", "chunk_id": "2b3a5af8f817eb3b", "doc_id": "hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Koshi Inaba">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Koshi Inaba is the vocalist/lyricist for B'z.", "chunk_id": "2b3a5af8f817eb3b", "doc_id": "hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c"}, {"text": "Koshi Inaba is a Japanese vocalist, multi-instrumentalist, and songwriter.", "chunk_id": "fa89540a3b417420", "doc_id": "hp_54bdec92cbf4fd9c"}, {"text": "Koshi Inaba is an artist for whom Hiroshi Asai participated in live concerts.", "chunk_id": "b0ac20241108f871", "doc_id": "hp_6f5bb567bd1d66b7"}, {"text": "A musician with whom Joshua Ray has toured.", "chunk_id": "6570bd376c908cac", "doc_id": "hp_9699bc0b1e483dfd"}, {"text": "Vocalist and lyricist for the Japanese rock duo B'z.", "chunk_id": "383c3a7435cb0e94", "doc_id": "hp_cee234b408138273"}, {"text": "Koshi Inaba is a Japanese singer, famous for being part of the band B'z.", "chunk_id": "ca46c02b980db182", "doc_id": "hp_e2dc91ec138a82f9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It came after a hiatus in which the members released solo projects, including vocalist/lyricist Koshi Inaba's \"Singing Bird\" and guitarist/composer Tak Matsumoto's \"New Horizon\".", "chunk_id": "2b3a5af8f817eb3b", "doc_id": "hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c"}, {"text": "Koshi Inaba (稲葉浩志 , Inaba Kōshi ) , born Hiroshi Inaba (稲葉浩志 , Inaba Hiroshi ) on September 23, 1964 in Tsuyama, Okayama, is a Japanese vocalist, multi-instrumentalist and songwriter.", "chunk_id": "fa89540a3b417420", "doc_id": "hp_54bdec92cbf4fd9c"}, {"text": "He participated in live concerts for artist such as Zard's since 1999, Koshi Inaba's solo live tours, Marie Ueda and Garnet Crow Symphonic Concert 2010 ~All Lovers~.", "chunk_id": "b0ac20241108f871", "doc_id": "hp_6f5bb567bd1d66b7"}, {"text": "Joshua has also toured with Koshi Inaba of B'z and blues artist Beth Hart.", "chunk_id": "6570bd376c908cac", "doc_id": "hp_9699bc0b1e483dfd"}, {"text": "B'z (ビーズ , Bīzu ) is a Japanese rock duo, consisting of guitarist, composer and producer Takahiro \"Tak\" Matsumoto (松本 孝弘 , Matsumoto Takahiro ) and vocalist and lyricist Koshi Inaba (稲葉 浩志 , Inaba Kōshi ) , known for their energetic hard-rock tracks and pop ballads.", "chunk_id": "383c3a7435cb0e94", "doc_id": "hp_cee234b408138273"}, {"text": "Singing Bird is the fifth solo studio album by Japanese singer Koshi Inaba, of B'z fame.", "chunk_id": "ca46c02b980db182", "doc_id": "hp_e2dc91ec138a82f9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_097f6b9639cd1b8c", "hp_54bdec92cbf4fd9c", "hp_6f5bb567bd1d66b7", "hp_9699bc0b1e483dfd", "hp_cee234b408138273", "hp_e2dc91ec138a82f9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
