<node id="Asno de las Encartaciones">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A breed of small domestic donkey from the western part of the Basque Country in north-east Spain.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The Asno de las Encartaciones , Basque: \"\" , is a breed of small domestic donkey from the western part of the autonomous community of the Basque Country, in north-east Spain.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Basque Country">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "An autonomous community in north-east Spain.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "A region in Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "The Basque country is a region that includes the province of Biscay.", "chunk_id": "25108324a3783908", "doc_id": "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The Asno de las Encartaciones , Basque: \"\" , is a breed of small domestic donkey from the western part of the autonomous community of the Basque Country, in north-east Spain.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "Enkarterri (Spanish: \"Las Encartaciones\") is a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque Country, Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "The Villano de Las Encartaciones (Basque: \"Enkarterriko billano\" , Cantabrian: \"Villanu\", English: Villein of las Encartaciones ) is a Spanish working dog originated in Las Encartaciones, a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque country, eastern Cantabria and northern Burgos.", "chunk_id": "25108324a3783908", "doc_id": "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a88edb8b9162de6", "hp_73ee189aee60b299", "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Spain">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A country in Europe.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "A country in Europe where the Villanuco de Las Encartaciones dog breed is typical.", "chunk_id": "e020cb702daeb7ff", "doc_id": "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258"}, {"text": "A country in Europe.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "A country where political parties were founded and merged.", "chunk_id": "da2cebd3507fe424", "doc_id": "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0"}, {"text": "Spain is a country where the Retuertas horse is indigenous and where ancient Iberian horses populated.", "chunk_id": "c416a15787294ca0", "doc_id": "hp_f5a05d2ab71d3e1b"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The Asno de las Encartaciones , Basque: \"\" , is a breed of small domestic donkey from the western part of the autonomous community of the Basque Country, in north-east Spain.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones (Basque: \"Enkarterriko billanuko\" , Cantabrian: \"Villanucu\", English: Little Villein of Las Encartaciones ) is a Spanish breed of dog typical of the region of Las Encartaciones (Biscay), Cantabria and northern Burgos (Spain).", "chunk_id": "e020cb702daeb7ff", "doc_id": "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258"}, {"text": "Enkarterri (Spanish: \"Las Encartaciones\") is a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque Country, Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "Falange Española de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional-Sindicalista (Spanish for \"Spanish Phalanx of the Councils of the National-Syndicalist Offensive\"; \"FE de las JONS\" for short), or simply called the \"Falange\" (  ), was a Fascist and National Syndicalist political party founded in 1934 in Spain as merger of the Falange Española (founded in October 1933) and the Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional-Sindicalista (founded in October 1931).", "chunk_id": "da2cebd3507fe424", "doc_id": "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0"}, {"text": "The Retuertas horse, Spanish: Caballo de las Retuertas or Caballo de las Retuertas de Doñana , is a rare breed of horse indigenous to the Andalusia region of Spain.", "chunk_id": "c416a15787294ca0", "doc_id": "hp_f5a05d2ab71d3e1b"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a88edb8b9162de6", "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258", "hp_73ee189aee60b299", "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0", "hp_f5a05d2ab71d3e1b"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Las Encartaciones">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A comarca in the province of Biscay.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "A region in Spain that is typical for the Villanuco de Las Encartaciones dog breed.", "chunk_id": "e020cb702daeb7ff", "doc_id": "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258"}, {"text": "The Spanish name for Enkarterri.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "Las Encartaciones is a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque country, eastern Cantabria and northern Burgos.", "chunk_id": "25108324a3783908", "doc_id": "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It is named for the comarca of Las Encartaciones (Enkarterri), in the province of Biscay (Bizkaia).", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones (Basque: \"Enkarterriko billanuko\" , Cantabrian: \"Villanucu\", English: Little Villein of Las Encartaciones ) is a Spanish breed of dog typical of the region of Las Encartaciones (Biscay), Cantabria and northern Burgos (Spain).", "chunk_id": "e020cb702daeb7ff", "doc_id": "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258"}, {"text": "Enkarterri (Spanish: \"Las Encartaciones\") is a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque Country, Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "The Villano de Las Encartaciones (Basque: \"Enkarterriko billano\" , Cantabrian: \"Villanu\", English: Villein of las Encartaciones ) is a Spanish working dog originated in Las Encartaciones, a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque country, eastern Cantabria and northern Burgos.", "chunk_id": "25108324a3783908", "doc_id": "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a88edb8b9162de6", "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258", "hp_73ee189aee60b299", "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Biscay">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A province in the Basque Country.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "A province in the Basque Country, Spain, part of the region of Las Encartaciones.", "chunk_id": "e020cb702daeb7ff", "doc_id": "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258"}, {"text": "A province in the Basque Country, Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "Biscay is a province in the Basque country.", "chunk_id": "25108324a3783908", "doc_id": "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It is named for the comarca of Las Encartaciones (Enkarterri), in the province of Biscay (Bizkaia).", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}, {"text": "The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones (Basque: \"Enkarterriko billanuko\" , Cantabrian: \"Villanucu\", English: Little Villein of Las Encartaciones ) is a Spanish breed of dog typical of the region of Las Encartaciones (Biscay), Cantabria and northern Burgos (Spain).", "chunk_id": "e020cb702daeb7ff", "doc_id": "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258"}, {"text": "Enkarterri (Spanish: \"Las Encartaciones\") is a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque Country, Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}, {"text": "The Villano de Las Encartaciones (Basque: \"Enkarterriko billano\" , Cantabrian: \"Villanu\", English: Villein of las Encartaciones ) is a Spanish working dog originated in Las Encartaciones, a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque country, eastern Cantabria and northern Burgos.", "chunk_id": "25108324a3783908", "doc_id": "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a88edb8b9162de6", "hp_0c6f0946ec61d258", "hp_73ee189aee60b299", "hp_cb38c3abf7bd85ae"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Gascon donkey">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A type of donkey that the Asno de las Encartaciones resembles.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It is the only small donkey breed of Spain, and resembles the Gascon donkey, now a sub-type of the Pyrenean donkey.", "chunk_id": "6c5e6325ed3b9eba", "doc_id": "hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a88edb8b9162de6"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
