<node id="Cretan Hound">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Cretan Hound is a type of warren hound with specific physical characteristics.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}, {"text": "The Cretan Hound, also known as the Kritikos Lagonikos, is a hunting breed of dog originating from Crete, Greece.", "chunk_id": "23bea06c26701fe1", "doc_id": "hp_9dcbf20f76a63e66"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "However, there are some exceptions: for instance, the Cretan Hound has usually rose-ears and a curly or curved tail, while the Barrocal Algarvio is long-haired.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}, {"text": "The Kritikos Lagonikos (Cretan Hound) (Greek:Kρητικός Λαγωνικός) is a hunting breed of dog from the island of Crete, in Greece.", "chunk_id": "23bea06c26701fe1", "doc_id": "hp_9dcbf20f76a63e66"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98", "hp_9dcbf20f76a63e66"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Barrocal Algarvio">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Barrocal Algarvio is a type of warren hound that is long-haired.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "However, there are some exceptions: for instance, the Cretan Hound has usually rose-ears and a curly or curved tail, while the Barrocal Algarvio is long-haired.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="sighthounds">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Sighthounds are a type of dog that rely on one sense.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Unlike hounds or sighthounds which rely on just one sense, warren hounds tend to work with three senses: smell, sight and hearing.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="smell">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Smell is one of the senses warren hounds use to work.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Unlike hounds or sighthounds which rely on just one sense, warren hounds tend to work with three senses: smell, sight and hearing.", "chunk_id": "4fb94dbd625515c2", "doc_id": "hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_0a96d1fd16b1ff98"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
