<node id="Zhejiang">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Zhejiang is a province in East China where Andatee sells oil fuel products.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}, {"text": "Zhejiang is a province in China.", "chunk_id": "6cbf95d958c94cd7", "doc_id": "hp_8f217e15be3875b3"}, {"text": "A province in China where Hangzhou is located.", "chunk_id": "b445d8e4dd3011b8", "doc_id": "hp_f8f508f7fcc4bad6"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The company sells oil fuel products mainly to one municipality directly under the central government and four big provinces in the Northeast and East of China, namely Tianjin, Liaoning, Shandong, Jiangsu and Zhejiang.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}, {"text": "Wenling (Wenling dialect: Uen-lin Zy ] ; ) is a coastal county-level city in the municipal region of Taizhou, in southeastern Zhejiang province, China.", "chunk_id": "6cbf95d958c94cd7", "doc_id": "hp_8f217e15be3875b3"}, {"text": "The Hangzhou–Ruili Expressway (), commonly referred to as the \"Hangrui Expressway\" () is an expressway in China that connects the cities of Hangzhou, Zhejiang, and Ruili, Yunnan, a city on the border with Burma.", "chunk_id": "b445d8e4dd3011b8", "doc_id": "hp_f8f508f7fcc4bad6"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831", "hp_8f217e15be3875b3", "hp_f8f508f7fcc4bad6"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Goodwill Rich International Limited">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Goodwill Rich International Limited is a subsidiary of Andatee China Marine Fuel Service Corporation.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The company has subsidiaries including Goodwill Rich International Limited, Dalian Fusheng Petrochemical Company (\"Fusheng\"), Fusheng's variable interest entity, and Xing Yuan.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
