  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Fusheng's variable interest entity is a subsidiary of Andatee China Marine Fuel Service Corporation.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The company has subsidiaries including Goodwill Rich International Limited, Dalian Fusheng Petrochemical Company (\"Fusheng\"), Fusheng's variable interest entity, and Xing Yuan.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Xing Yuan">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Xing Yuan is a subsidiary of Andatee China Marine Fuel Service Corporation and a joint-venture with the Dalian subsidiary of CPC Corp.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The company's subsidiary, Xing Yuan, founded in 2001, is a joint-venture with the Dalian subsidiary of CPC Corp.(China Petroleum and Chemical Corporation), which is the largest petroleum company in China.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="CPC Corp.">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "CPC Corp. is the largest petroleum company in China and has a joint-venture with Xing Yuan.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The company's subsidiary, Xing Yuan, founded in 2001, is a joint-venture with the Dalian subsidiary of CPC Corp.(China Petroleum and Chemical Corporation), which is the largest petroleum company in China.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="China Petroleum and Chemical Corporation">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "China Petroleum and Chemical Corporation is the largest petroleum company in China and has a joint-venture with Xing Yuan.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The company's subsidiary, Xing Yuan, founded in 2001, is a joint-venture with the Dalian subsidiary of CPC Corp.(China Petroleum and Chemical Corporation), which is the largest petroleum company in China.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="2001">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "2001 is the year Xing Yuan was founded.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The company's subsidiary, Xing Yuan, founded in 2001, is a joint-venture with the Dalian subsidiary of CPC Corp.(China Petroleum and Chemical Corporation), which is the largest petroleum company in China.", "chunk_id": "0ae16a4e4e4c0144", "doc_id": "hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e1ee8b3317b2831"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Ayakapı">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Ayakapı is a quarter of Istanbul, Turkey, named after a church dedicated to Saint Theodosia.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Ayakapı (Turkish: \"The Gate of the Saint\", \"The holy gate\" ) (the toponym comes from the Turkish word \"Aya\", derived from pronunciation of the Greek word ἁγἰα, mean. \"female Saint\" and the Turkish word \"kapı\", mean. \"gate\") is a quarter of Istanbul, Turkey.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Fatih">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Fatih is a district in Istanbul, of which Ayakapı is a part.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It is part of the district of Fatih, inside the walled city, and lies on the shore of the Golden Horn.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Golden Horn">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Golden Horn is a body of water on the shore of which Ayakapı lies.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It is part of the district of Fatih, inside the walled city, and lies on the shore of the Golden Horn.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Byzantine era">
  <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Byzantine era was a period when Ayakapı was known as ta Dexiokratiana or ta Dexiokratous.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "During the Byzantine era, it was named ta Dexiokratiana or ta Dexiokratous in Greek, after the houses owned here by a certain Dexiokrates.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="ta Dexiokratiana">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "ta Dexiokratiana was the name of Ayakapı during the Byzantine era.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "During the Byzantine era, it was named ta Dexiokratiana or ta Dexiokratous in Greek, after the houses owned here by a certain Dexiokrates.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="ta Dexiokratous">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "ta Dexiokratous was the name of Ayakapı during the Byzantine era.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "During the Byzantine era, it was named ta Dexiokratiana or ta Dexiokratous in Greek, after the houses owned here by a certain Dexiokrates.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Dexiokrates">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Dexiokrates owned houses in the area that was later named Ayakapı.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "During the Byzantine era, it was named ta Dexiokratiana or ta Dexiokratous in Greek, after the houses owned here by a certain Dexiokrates.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Saint Theodosia">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Saint Theodosia is a saint to whom a church near Ayakapı was dedicated.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Its modern name comes from a church dedicated to Saint Theodosia which, according to Petrus Gillius, stood near the gate.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Petrus Gillius">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Petrus Gillius is a source who stated that a church dedicated to Saint Theodosia stood near Ayakapı.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Its modern name comes from a church dedicated to Saint Theodosia which, according to Petrus Gillius, stood near the gate.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Gül Mosque">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Gül Mosque is one of the most important surviving Byzantine buildings of the historical peninsula, located in Ayakapı.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}, {"text": "A former Eastern Orthodox church in Istanbul, Turkey, that was converted into a mosque by the Ottomans.", "chunk_id": "8567d31eef2db61e", "doc_id": "hp_7afc03b2a09c3287"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In Ayakapı lies one of the most important surviving Byzantine buildings of the historical peninsula, the Gül Mosque.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}, {"text": "Gül Mosque (Turkish: \"Gül Camii\" , meaning: \"The Mosque of the Rose\" in English) is a former Eastern Orthodox church in Istanbul, Turkey, converted into a mosque by the Ottomans.", "chunk_id": "8567d31eef2db61e", "doc_id": "hp_7afc03b2a09c3287"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1", "hp_7afc03b2a09c3287"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Ottoman architect Sinan">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Ottoman architect Sinan built a Turkish bath in Ayakapı in 1582.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Moreover, in 1582 the Ottoman architect Sinan built here a Turkish bath, the Ayakapı Hamamı.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Ayakapı Hamamı">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Ayakapı Hamamı is a Turkish bath built by Sinan in Ayakapı in 1582, currently used as a storage for timber.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Moreover, in 1582 the Ottoman architect Sinan built here a Turkish bath, the Ayakapı Hamamı.", "chunk_id": "6e81cc2224f69a7f", "doc_id": "hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e26d1b1943ab6e1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Manon Lescaut">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A novel by French author Abbé Prévost, also known as \"L'Histoire du chevalier des Grieux et de Manon Lescaut\".", "chunk_id": "1a052a3777da7f37", "doc_id": "hp_1e281004ae376688"}, {"text": "A 1731 novel by Antoine François Prévost.", "chunk_id": "bef25c1257301257", "doc_id": "hp_921687d29866a375"}, {"text": "Manon Lescaut is a story by François Prévost that has been retold and adapted into operas.", "chunk_id": "8dbccb5758e54e3f", "doc_id": "hp_ce10cea1030952d1"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Manon Lescaut (\"L'Histoire du chevalier des Grieux et de Manon Lescaut\") is a novel by French author Abbé Prévost.", "chunk_id": "1a052a3777da7f37", "doc_id": "hp_1e281004ae376688"}, {"text": "It is based on the 1731 novel \"Manon Lescaut\" by Antoine François Prévost, which has been made into films on a number of occasions.", "chunk_id": "bef25c1257301257", "doc_id": "hp_921687d29866a375"}, {"text": "Boulevard Solitude is a \"Lyrisches Drama \" (lyric drama) or opera in one act by Hans Werner Henze to a German libretto by Grete Weil after the play by Walter Jockisch, in its turn a modern retelling of François Prévost's \"Manon Lescaut\".", "chunk_id": "8dbccb5758e54e3f", "doc_id": "hp_ce10cea1030952d1"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e281004ae376688", "hp_921687d29866a375", "hp_ce10cea1030952d1"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Abbé Prévost">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The French author of the novel Manon Lescaut.", "chunk_id": "1a052a3777da7f37", "doc_id": "hp_1e281004ae376688"}, {"text": "The author of the novel 'Manon Lescaut'.", "chunk_id": "472783879983a24b", "doc_id": "hp_36399bb9e18cf019"}, {"text": "The author of the 1731 novel \"L'histoire du chevalier des Grieux et de Manon Lescaut\".", "chunk_id": "41a807c0946f5ef1", "doc_id": "hp_de6d3adc813848a7"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Manon Lescaut (\"L'Histoire du chevalier des Grieux et de Manon Lescaut\") is a novel by French author Abbé Prévost.", "chunk_id": "1a052a3777da7f37", "doc_id": "hp_1e281004ae376688"}, {"text": "It is an adaptation of the Abbé Prévost's novel \"Manon Lescaut\" (1731).", "chunk_id": "472783879983a24b", "doc_id": "hp_36399bb9e18cf019"}, {"text": "The story is based on the 1731 novel \"L'histoire du chevalier des Grieux et de Manon Lescaut\" by the Abbé Prévost and should not be confused with \"Manon\", an 1884 opera by Jules Massenet based on the same novel.", "chunk_id": "41a807c0946f5ef1", "doc_id": "hp_de6d3adc813848a7"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e281004ae376688", "hp_36399bb9e18cf019", "hp_de6d3adc813848a7"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Mémoires et aventures d'un homme de qualité">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A collection of memoirs and adventures of a man of quality, of which Manon Lescaut is the seventh and final volume.", "chunk_id": "1a052a3777da7f37", "doc_id": "hp_1e281004ae376688"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Published in 1731, it is the seventh and final volume of \"Mémoires et aventures d'un homme de qualité\" (\"Memoirs and Adventures of a Man of Quality\").", "chunk_id": "1a052a3777da7f37", "doc_id": "hp_1e281004ae376688"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_1e281004ae376688"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
