<node id="José Luis Castillejo">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "José Luis Castillejo was a writer and diplomat who made major contributions to Zaj.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The group received major contributions by different artists from the Spanish avant-garde scene, notably from the writer and diplomat José Luis Castillejo and from the interdisciplinary artist Esther Ferrer.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_205b52451626bfb6"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Esther Ferrer">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Esther Ferrer was an interdisciplinary artist who made major contributions to Zaj.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The group received major contributions by different artists from the Spanish avant-garde scene, notably from the writer and diplomat José Luis Castillejo and from the interdisciplinary artist Esther Ferrer.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_205b52451626bfb6"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Fluxus">
  <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Fluxus was an international network and cultural movement.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "An international group of avant-garde artists centered on George Maciunas.", "chunk_id": "bb303342f684188a", "doc_id": "hp_25e106b688a6f938"}, {"text": "An experimental art movement from the sixties.", "chunk_id": "90b05205269973c5", "doc_id": "hp_51b683ecaa90fcc5"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "During the 1960s, members of Zaj took part in different Fluxus events organised by George Maciunas.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "She was a key member and influence on Fluxus, the international group of avant-garde artists centered on George Maciunas, having been involved with the group since witnessing John Cage perform in Tokyo in 1962 and subsequently moving to New York in 1964.", "chunk_id": "bb303342f684188a", "doc_id": "hp_25e106b688a6f938"}, {"text": "The piece involves the manipulation of electric metronomes, followed by various unspecified sounds and actions.", "chunk_id": "90b05205269973c5", "doc_id": "hp_51b683ecaa90fcc5"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_205b52451626bfb6", "hp_25e106b688a6f938", "hp_51b683ecaa90fcc5"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="George Maciunas">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "George Maciunas organized Fluxus events.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "The central figure of the international group of avant-garde artists known as Fluxus.", "chunk_id": "bb303342f684188a", "doc_id": "hp_25e106b688a6f938"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "During the 1960s, members of Zaj took part in different Fluxus events organised by George Maciunas.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "She was a key member and influence on Fluxus, the international group of avant-garde artists centered on George Maciunas, having been involved with the group since witnessing John Cage perform in Tokyo in 1962 and subsequently moving to New York in 1964.", "chunk_id": "bb303342f684188a", "doc_id": "hp_25e106b688a6f938"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_205b52451626bfb6", "hp_25e106b688a6f938"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Mimi Johnson">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Mimi Johnson was the agent of John Cage.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "With the help of John Cage and his agent Mimi Johnson, Zaj also toured in different cities in the United States in the late 1970s.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_205b52451626bfb6"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Milan">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Milan is a city in Italy where Zaj was formed.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "The city in Italy where the Native Tour began.", "chunk_id": "fbf2e81187688813", "doc_id": "hp_bf77c9d36b5389d5"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Zaj was an experimental music and performance art group formed in 1959 in Milan, Italy by composers and intermedia artists Walter Marchetti and Juan Hidalgo with the support of the American composer John Cage.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "The tour began on April 2, 2013, in Milan, Italy and finished on September 20, 2015, in São Paulo, Brazil.", "chunk_id": "fbf2e81187688813", "doc_id": "hp_bf77c9d36b5389d5"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_205b52451626bfb6", "hp_bf77c9d36b5389d5"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Italy">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Italy is a country where Milan is located.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "A country where Busseto is located.", "chunk_id": "63570f207001f1f0", "doc_id": "hp_22c8c1dec547c159"}, {"text": "A country involved in the distribution of a book celebrating the discovery of America.", "chunk_id": "eba842781d3e0f53", "doc_id": "hp_2fa6e4f30229c0a7"}, {"text": "Italy is a country where Ferdinando Provesi was a native of.", "chunk_id": "6f1f0a0b8ceacebf", "doc_id": "hp_504f3a1745c4e938"}, {"text": "A country consisting of a peninsula in Southern Europe.", "chunk_id": "d43d20bf97a0fc28", "doc_id": "hp_56ae2e2bc0735743"}, {"text": "Italy is a country in Europe.", "chunk_id": "7774f7d0fd5a7c20", "doc_id": "hp_768bd041b089468b"}, {"text": "A country where the poet studied and can still hear the tree's lament.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734"}, {"text": "The country where Milan is located, and where the Native Tour began.", "chunk_id": "fbf2e81187688813", "doc_id": "hp_bf77c9d36b5389d5"}, {"text": "A country where Dancing on Ice has been a prime-time hit.", "chunk_id": "11198ab313088443", "doc_id": "hp_d35c5fabe367cde8"}, {"text": "Italy is a country.", "chunk_id": "90aa0e3b675f8e93", "doc_id": "hp_e9d687a7dd49fca0"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Zaj was an experimental music and performance art group formed in 1959 in Milan, Italy by composers and intermedia artists Walter Marchetti and Juan Hidalgo with the support of the American composer John Cage.", "chunk_id": "b647f648f08782f6", "doc_id": "hp_205b52451626bfb6"}, {"text": "Teatro Giuseppe Verdi (the Giuseppe Verdi Theatre) is a small opera house located in a wing of the Rocca dei Marchesi Pallavicino on the Piazza Giuseppe Verdi in Busseto, Italy, a town closely associated with the life of the opera composer, Giuseppe Verdi.", "chunk_id": "63570f207001f1f0", "doc_id": "hp_22c8c1dec547c159"}, {"text": "This would be published in a book, together with stories by Norman Mailer and Carlos Fuentes, which would be handed out to passengers flying between Italy and Central, North and South America in 1992, the year of the fifth centennial.", "chunk_id": "eba842781d3e0f53", "doc_id": "hp_2fa6e4f30229c0a7"}, {"text": "Ferdinando Angelo Maria Provesi (1770 – 1833) was a native of Parma, Italy.", "chunk_id": "6f1f0a0b8ceacebf", "doc_id": "hp_504f3a1745c4e938"}, {"text": "He transferred to the third-rate HMS \"Edinburgh\" and landed troops at Viareggio in Italy in November 1812 later in that War.", "chunk_id": "d43d20bf97a0fc28", "doc_id": "hp_56ae2e2bc0735743"}, {"text": "After a match between Romania and Italy, played in Rome, he was nicknamed by the Italian football fans \"Il Dio\", because of his incredible saves.", "chunk_id": "7774f7d0fd5a7c20", "doc_id": "hp_768bd041b089468b"}, {"text": "Even in France and Italy (where the poet studied), she can hear the tree's lament.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734"}, {"text": "The tour began on April 2, 2013, in Milan, Italy and finished on September 20, 2015, in São Paulo, Brazil.", "chunk_id": "fbf2e81187688813", "doc_id": "hp_bf77c9d36b5389d5"}, {"text": "The format, devised by London Weekend Television and Granada Television for ITV, has been a prime-time hit in eight different countries, including Britain and subsequently in Italy and Chile.", "chunk_id": "11198ab313088443", "doc_id": "hp_d35c5fabe367cde8"}, {"text": "Parma Airport (Italian: \"Aeroporto di Parma\" , IATA: PMF, ICAO: LIMP ) is located 1.3 NM northwest of Parma, a city in the Emilia-Romagna region of Italy.", "chunk_id": "90aa0e3b675f8e93", "doc_id": "hp_e9d687a7dd49fca0"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_205b52451626bfb6", "hp_22c8c1dec547c159", "hp_2fa6e4f30229c0a7", "hp_504f3a1745c4e938", "hp_56ae2e2bc0735743", "hp_768bd041b089468b", "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "hp_bf77c9d36b5389d5", "hp_d35c5fabe367cde8", "hp_e9d687a7dd49fca0"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
