<node id="Sony Bravia &quot;Balls&quot;">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Sony Bravia \"Balls\" is a notable example of Peacefrog Records' music being synced to film and television.", "chunk_id": "1c1d19351df2d318", "doc_id": "hp_28fb4ee88cd9de85"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Notable examples of this include the 2006 iconic Sony Bravia \"Balls\" (Jose Gonzalez) and in 2011, Twinings \"Sea\" (Charlene Soraia).", "chunk_id": "1c1d19351df2d318", "doc_id": "hp_28fb4ee88cd9de85"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_28fb4ee88cd9de85"]</data>
