  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Mark Anthony \"Baz\" Luhrmann ( ; born 17 September 1962) is an Australian film director, screenwriter and producer best known for \"Red Curtain Trilogy\", comprising his romantic comedy film \"Strictly Ballroom\" (1992), the romantic drama \"Romeo + Juliet\" (1996), and the pastiche-jukebox musical \"Moulin Rouge!\" (2001).", "chunk_id": "6e2520e76c300111", "doc_id": "hp_2f6efd859dd967a9"}, {"text": "The title of the show suggests a continuation of the long-running series \"Come Dancing\", with an allusion to the film \"Strictly Ballroom\".", "chunk_id": "2b519def9b11851e", "doc_id": "hp_4bc5842422a7c734"}]</data>
