<node id="French &amp; Saunders">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A 1990 sketch created by Jennifer Saunders and Dawn French, which served as the basis for Absolutely Fabulous.", "chunk_id": "f54971948ab8acd8", "doc_id": "hp_327a998a822bc9e6"}, {"text": "\"French &amp; Saunders\" is a show during which the spoof group Lananeeneenoonoo was introduced.", "chunk_id": "c11c9287534c04db", "doc_id": "hp_57f0c97f7881985b"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It is based on a 1990 \"French &amp; Saunders\" sketch created by Saunders and Dawn French.", "chunk_id": "f54971948ab8acd8", "doc_id": "hp_327a998a822bc9e6"}, {"text": "The group, and its name, was a spoof on the popular group Bananarama and was introduced during the 1988 Christmas Special of \"French &amp; Saunders\", in which Burke was a guest.", "chunk_id": "c11c9287534c04db", "doc_id": "hp_57f0c97f7881985b"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_327a998a822bc9e6", "hp_57f0c97f7881985b"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Dawn French">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "An English comedian, actor, and writer who co-created the \"French &amp; Saunders\" sketch.", "chunk_id": "f54971948ab8acd8", "doc_id": "hp_327a998a822bc9e6"}, {"text": "Dawn French is a comedian and a member of the spoof group Lananeeneenoonoo.", "chunk_id": "c11c9287534c04db", "doc_id": "hp_57f0c97f7881985b"}, {"text": "An actress who starred in the British sitcom 'Let Them Eat Cake'.", "chunk_id": "3fa71aaae5f778d3", "doc_id": "hp_66c764ac56267d4d"}, {"text": "A comic who is part of the duo French and Saunders.", "chunk_id": "0cba2f1e48972df0", "doc_id": "hp_a43a1b7d6bf4ac88"}, {"text": "Dawn French is an English actress, writer, and comedian.", "chunk_id": "8f5e1ed518366291", "doc_id": "hp_b150127ee448fafd"}, {"text": "A member of the comedy duo French and Saunders.", "chunk_id": "da03dc4aa612a116", "doc_id": "hp_b1fcfbca9c340147"}, {"text": "A star of the sitcom Jam &amp; Jerusalem.", "chunk_id": "0a9ce939e4324315", "doc_id": "hp_e874da810d9b0fb1"}, {"text": "Dawn French is an actress who starred in the film The Supergrass.", "chunk_id": "3490da9f777ecd88", "doc_id": "hp_f962c6bd05ae98f7"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "It is based on a 1990 \"French &amp; Saunders\" sketch created by Saunders and Dawn French.", "chunk_id": "f54971948ab8acd8", "doc_id": "hp_327a998a822bc9e6"}, {"text": "Lananeeneenoonoo was a British spoof all-girl group consisting of comedians Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders and Kathy Burke.", "chunk_id": "c11c9287534c04db", "doc_id": "hp_57f0c97f7881985b"}, {"text": "Starring Dawn French and Jennifer Saunders, it is one of the few programmes in which French and Saunders have appeared which they did not create themselves.", "chunk_id": "3fa71aaae5f778d3", "doc_id": "hp_66c764ac56267d4d"}, {"text": "French and Saunders is a British sketch comedy television series written by and starring comic duo Dawn French and Jennifer Saunders.", "chunk_id": "0cba2f1e48972df0", "doc_id": "hp_a43a1b7d6bf4ac88"}, {"text": "Dawn Roma French (born 11 October 1957) is an English actress, writer, and comedian.", "chunk_id": "8f5e1ed518366291", "doc_id": "hp_b150127ee448fafd"}, {"text": "French and Saunders: Still Alive! is a 2008 tour by comedy duo Dawn French and Jennifer Saunders.", "chunk_id": "da03dc4aa612a116", "doc_id": "hp_b1fcfbca9c340147"}, {"text": "Written by Jennifer Saunders and Abigail Wilson, it starred Sue Johnston, Jennifer Saunders, Pauline McLynn, Dawn French, Maggie Steed, David Mitchell, and Sally Phillips.", "chunk_id": "0a9ce939e4324315", "doc_id": "hp_e874da810d9b0fb1"}, {"text": "The film starred Richardson, Adrian Edmondson, Jennifer Saunders, Dawn French, Keith Allen, Nigel Planer, Alexei Sayle, Ronald Allen and Robbie Coltrane.", "chunk_id": "3490da9f777ecd88", "doc_id": "hp_f962c6bd05ae98f7"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_327a998a822bc9e6", "hp_57f0c97f7881985b", "hp_66c764ac56267d4d", "hp_a43a1b7d6bf4ac88", "hp_b150127ee448fafd", "hp_b1fcfbca9c340147", "hp_e874da810d9b0fb1", "hp_f962c6bd05ae98f7"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Pinguicula moranensis">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Pinguicula moranensis is a perennial rosette-forming insectivorous herb native to Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Pinguicula moranensis is a perennial rosette-forming insectivorous herb native to Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_32c049306a94f329"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Guatemala">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Guatemala is a country where Pinguicula moranensis is native to.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}, {"text": "Guatemala is a country of origin for Pinguicula orchidioides.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}, {"text": "Guatemala is a location where the species Agave ghiesbreghtii is endemic.", "chunk_id": "4b63b68e70b8a72b", "doc_id": "hp_b6c911ef5c542694"}, {"text": "A country in Central America.", "chunk_id": "cfcc8f8ff86d83c3", "doc_id": "hp_dbf42d0cc7b618be"}, {"text": "Guatemala is a country where Weldenia candida originally grows.", "chunk_id": "8fba6fc0a1ff107a", "doc_id": "hp_ead206f3625040bb"}, {"text": "A country in Central America.", "chunk_id": "ae8a20956c4e25a8", "doc_id": "hp_f73d55cc65e5508e"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Pinguicula moranensis is a perennial rosette-forming insectivorous herb native to Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}, {"text": "Pinguicula orchidioides is a perennial rosette-forming insectivorous herb native to Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}, {"text": "The species is endemic in Guatemala and the State of Mexico in Mexico.", "chunk_id": "4b63b68e70b8a72b", "doc_id": "hp_b6c911ef5c542694"}, {"text": "Stenocereus (Gk. stenos, narrow, L. cereus, candle) is a genus of columnar or tree-like cacti from the Baja California Peninsula and other parts of Mexico, Arizona in the United States, Colombia, Costa Rica, Guatemala, Venezuela and the ABC islands of the Dutch Caribbean.", "chunk_id": "cfcc8f8ff86d83c3", "doc_id": "hp_dbf42d0cc7b618be"}, {"text": "It has one single species: Weldenia candida, which grows originally in Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "8fba6fc0a1ff107a", "doc_id": "hp_ead206f3625040bb"}, {"text": "Philadelphus mexicanus is a shrub belonging to the genus \"Philadelphus\", native to Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "ae8a20956c4e25a8", "doc_id": "hp_f73d55cc65e5508e"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_32c049306a94f329", "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9", "hp_b6c911ef5c542694", "hp_dbf42d0cc7b618be", "hp_ead206f3625040bb", "hp_f73d55cc65e5508e"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="butterwort">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A species of butterwort, it forms summer rosettes of flat, succulent leaves up to 10 centimeters (4 in) long, which are covered in mucilaginous (sticky) glands that attract, trap, and digest arthropod prey.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}, {"text": "A species of butterwort, it forms summer rosettes of flat, succulent leaves up to 5 centimeters (4 in) long, which are covered in mucilagenous (sticky) glands that attract, trap, and digest arthropod prey.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "A species of butterwort, it forms summer rosettes of flat, succulent leaves up to 10\tcentimeters (4\tin) long, which are covered in mucilaginous (sticky) glands that attract, trap, and digest arthropod prey.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}, {"text": "A species of butterwort, it forms summer rosettes of flat, succulent leaves up to 5\tcentimeters (4\tin) long, which are covered in mucilagenous (sticky) glands that attract, trap, and digest arthropod prey.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_32c049306a94f329", "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="arthropod prey">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Arthropod prey are attracted, trapped, and digested by the glands on the leaves of Pinguicula moranensis.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}, {"text": "Arthropod prey are attracted, trapped, and digested by the glands on the leaves of Pinguicula orchidioides.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "A species of butterwort, it forms summer rosettes of flat, succulent leaves up to 10\tcentimeters (4\tin) long, which are covered in mucilaginous (sticky) glands that attract, trap, and digest arthropod prey.", "chunk_id": "c64585feaab7ebe5", "doc_id": "hp_32c049306a94f329"}, {"text": "A species of butterwort, it forms summer rosettes of flat, succulent leaves up to 5\tcentimeters (4\tin) long, which are covered in mucilagenous (sticky) glands that attract, trap, and digest arthropod prey.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_32c049306a94f329", "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
