<node id="Midlake">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Midlake is a band associated with Eric Pulido, Jesse Chandler, Joey McClellan, and McKenzie Smith.", "chunk_id": "161799124afdf1e1", "doc_id": "hp_6a39ea6d8c8a05f8"}, {"text": "A band that Eric Pulido is a part of and whose other members backed BNQT.", "chunk_id": "f0e4892b3b37bba4", "doc_id": "hp_7cc233817d9e07c7"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "BNQT (pronounced banquet ( ) is an indie super-group featuring Fran Healy (Travis), Alex Kapranos (Franz Ferdinand), Eric Pulido (Midlake), Ben Bridwell (Band of Horses) and Jason Lytle (Grandaddy), backed by other members of Midlake; Jesse Chandler, Joey McClellan and McKenzie Smith.", "chunk_id": "161799124afdf1e1", "doc_id": "hp_6a39ea6d8c8a05f8"}, {"text": "Volume 1 is the debut studio album by indie super-group BNQT, lead by Eric Pulido (Midlake) with Ben Bridwell (Band of Horses), Alex Kapranos (Franz Ferdinand), Fran Healy (Travis) and Jason Lytle (Grandaddy), backed by the other members of Midlake.", "chunk_id": "f0e4892b3b37bba4", "doc_id": "hp_7cc233817d9e07c7"}]</data>
