<node id="Henri Larrivée">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Henri Larrivée was a French opera singer.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Henri Larrivée (9 January 1737 – 7 August 1802) was a French opera singer.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Lyon">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Lyon is the birthplace of Henri Larrivée.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He was born in Lyon.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="basse-taille">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Basse-taille is a voice range equivalent to baritone.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "His voice range was \"basse-taille\" (equivalent to baritone).", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Fétis">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Fétis is a source of information about Larrivée's career.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "According to Fétis, Larrivée was working as an apprentice to a wigmaker when the head of the Paris Opéra, Rebel, noticed his talent for singing and hired him as a chorus member.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Paris Opéra">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Paris Opéra is an opera house where Larrivée was hired as a chorus member.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "According to Fétis, Larrivée was working as an apprentice to a wigmaker when the head of the Paris Opéra, Rebel, noticed his talent for singing and hired him as a chorus member.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Rebel">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Rebel was the head of the Paris Opéra who hired Larrivée.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "According to Fétis, Larrivée was working as an apprentice to a wigmaker when the head of the Paris Opéra, Rebel, noticed his talent for singing and hired him as a chorus member.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Rameau">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Rameau composed the opera \"Castor et Pollux\".", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}, {"text": "The composer of the opera 'Castor et Pollux'.", "chunk_id": "b9a0568248760524", "doc_id": "hp_e9ebf1cff727fec5"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He made his first solo appearance as a high priest in a 1755 revival of Rameau's \"Castor et Pollux\".", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}, {"text": "The libretto was one translated by Carlo Innocenzo Frugoni, from Pierre-Joseph-Justin Bernard's French text for Rameau's \"Castor et Pollux\".", "chunk_id": "b9a0568248760524", "doc_id": "hp_e9ebf1cff727fec5"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd", "hp_e9ebf1cff727fec5"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Castor et Pollux">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Castor et Pollux is an opera by Rameau.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}, {"text": "An opera by Rameau.", "chunk_id": "b9a0568248760524", "doc_id": "hp_e9ebf1cff727fec5"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He made his first solo appearance as a high priest in a 1755 revival of Rameau's \"Castor et Pollux\".", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}, {"text": "The libretto was one translated by Carlo Innocenzo Frugoni, from Pierre-Joseph-Justin Bernard's French text for Rameau's \"Castor et Pollux\".", "chunk_id": "b9a0568248760524", "doc_id": "hp_e9ebf1cff727fec5"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd", "hp_e9ebf1cff727fec5"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Christoph Willibald von Gluck">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Christoph Willibald von Gluck was a composer whose works Larrivée was associated with.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He was particularly associated with the works of Christoph Willibald von Gluck, helping Gluck establish his \"reform operas\" in France.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="reform operas">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Reform operas are a type of opera associated with Gluck.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He was particularly associated with the works of Christoph Willibald von Gluck, helping Gluck establish his \"reform operas\" in France.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Niccolò Piccinni">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Niccolò Piccinni was a rival of Gluck with whom Larrivée also worked.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He found Gluck's rival, Niccolò Piccinni, less congenial but still worked with him on the premieres of operas including \"Roland\" (1778).", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Roland">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Roland is an opera premiered in 1778.", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He found Gluck's rival, Niccolò Piccinni, less congenial but still worked with him on the premieres of operas including \"Roland\" (1778).", "chunk_id": "e5b8f20d23f949cd", "doc_id": "hp_6a489e030aae67cd"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a489e030aae67cd"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Pinguicula orchidioides">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Pinguicula orchidioides is a perennial rosette-forming insectivorous herb native to Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Pinguicula orchidioides is a perennial rosette-forming insectivorous herb native to Mexico and Guatemala.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Pinguicula">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Pinguicula is a genus of plants, and Pinguicula orchidioides is a species within this genus from the Americas.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Uniquely among \"Pinguicula\" species from the Americas, \"p. orchidioides\" produces gemma-like basal buds which elongate into stolons and serve as a means of asexual reproduction.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="gemma-like basal buds">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Gemma-like basal buds are produced by Pinguicula orchidioides and elongate into stolons for asexual reproduction.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Uniquely among \"Pinguicula\" species from the Americas, \"p. orchidioides\" produces gemma-like basal buds which elongate into stolons and serve as a means of asexual reproduction.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="stolons">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Stolons are formed from the elongation of gemma-like basal buds in Pinguicula orchidioides and serve as a means of asexual reproduction.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Uniquely among \"Pinguicula\" species from the Americas, \"p. orchidioides\" produces gemma-like basal buds which elongate into stolons and serve as a means of asexual reproduction.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="purple flowers">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Single purple flowers appear between July and September on upright stalks up to 22 centimeters long.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Single purple flowers appear between July and September on upright stalks up to 22 centimeters long.", "chunk_id": "1184555da09f3dbe", "doc_id": "hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a6940496f3fa2b9"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Gayathri Venkataraghavan">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Gayathri Venkataraghavan is an Indian Carnatic vocalist.", "chunk_id": "8b6a7287fdd98325", "doc_id": "hp_6a866249e65a5806"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Gayathri Venkataraghavan (Tamil: காயத்ரி வெங்கட்ராகவன்) is an Indian Carnatic vocalist.", "chunk_id": "8b6a7287fdd98325", "doc_id": "hp_6a866249e65a5806"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a866249e65a5806"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Carnatic vocalist">
  <data key="d0">CONCEPT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A Carnatic vocalist is a singer of Carnatic music, a system of music associated with South India.", "chunk_id": "8b6a7287fdd98325", "doc_id": "hp_6a866249e65a5806"}, {"text": "A Carnatic vocalist is a singer who performs Carnatic music, a system of music associated with South India.", "chunk_id": "1dc246b063ed2b56", "doc_id": "hp_990cb25e632f49e0"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Gayathri Venkataraghavan (Tamil: காயத்ரி வெங்கட்ராகவன்) is an Indian Carnatic vocalist.", "chunk_id": "8b6a7287fdd98325", "doc_id": "hp_6a866249e65a5806"}, {"text": "Neyveli Santhanagopalan (born 1963) is an Indian Carnatic vocalist.", "chunk_id": "1dc246b063ed2b56", "doc_id": "hp_990cb25e632f49e0"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_6a866249e65a5806", "hp_990cb25e632f49e0"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
