<node id="Everett Piper">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Everett Piper is an American university administrator.", "chunk_id": "f35ab4c4b3bafc46", "doc_id": "hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Everett Piper", "chunk_id": "f35ab4c4b3bafc46", "doc_id": "hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Dr. Everett Piper">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Dr. Everett Piper was born in 1959 and is an American university administrator.", "chunk_id": "f35ab4c4b3bafc46", "doc_id": "hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Dr. Everett Piper (born 1959) is an American university administrator.", "chunk_id": "f35ab4c4b3bafc46", "doc_id": "hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Oklahoma Wesleyan University">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Oklahoma Wesleyan University is an institution where Dr. Everett Piper serves as President.", "chunk_id": "f35ab4c4b3bafc46", "doc_id": "hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Since August 2002, he has been President of Oklahoma Wesleyan University.", "chunk_id": "f35ab4c4b3bafc46", "doc_id": "hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_7192edf4cef8ea94"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="M6 highway (Russia)">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Russian route M6, also known as the \"Caspian Highway\", is a major trunk road linking Moscow to the Caspian Sea.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The Russian route M6 (or Р22, also known as the \"Caspian Highway\") is a major trunk road that links Moscow to the Caspian Sea.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Р22">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Р22 is an alternative designation for the Russian route M6, also known as the \"Caspian Highway\".", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The Russian route M6 (or Р22, also known as the \"Caspian Highway\") is a major trunk road that links Moscow to the Caspian Sea.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Caspian Highway">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The \"Caspian Highway\" is an alternative name for the Russian route M6.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The Russian route M6 (or Р22, also known as the \"Caspian Highway\") is a major trunk road that links Moscow to the Caspian Sea.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Caspian Sea">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Caspian Sea is the destination of the M6 highway from Moscow.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The Russian route M6 (or Р22, also known as the \"Caspian Highway\") is a major trunk road that links Moscow to the Caspian Sea.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="M4">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "M4 is a route that the M6 highway runs concurrent with from Moscow to Stupino.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Stupino">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Stupino is a location where the M6 highway runs concurrent with M4 and then branches off.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Ryazan Oblast">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Ryazan Oblast is a region in Russia that the M6 highway passes through southeast of Stupino.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Tambov Oblast">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Tambov Oblast is a region in Russia that the M6 highway passes through southeast of Stupino.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Voronezh Oblast">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Voronezh Oblast is a region in Russia that the M6 highway passes through southeast of Stupino.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Volgograd Oblast">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Volgograd Oblast is a region in Russia that the M6 highway passes through southeast of Stupino.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Volga River">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Volga River is a river along whose right bank the M6 highway runs through Volgograd.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Volgograd">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Volgograd is a city through which the M6 highway runs along the right bank of the Volga River.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Astrakhan">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Astrakhan is the terminating city of the M6 highway.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The road runs concurrent with route M4 from Moscow to Stupino, then branches off south of Stupino and goes southeast across Ryazan Oblast, Tambov Oblast, Voronezh Oblast, and Volgograd Oblast, running along the right bank of the Volga River through Volgograd before terminating at Astrakhan.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="European route E119">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The entire route of the M6 highway is part of the European route E119.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The entire route is part of the European route E119, and the stretch between Volgograd and Astrakhan is part of the European route E40.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="European route E40">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The stretch of the M6 highway between Volgograd and Astrakhan is part of the European route E40.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The entire route is part of the European route E119, and the stretch between Volgograd and Astrakhan is part of the European route E40.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="2018">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "In 2018, the northern terminus of the M6 highway will be moved.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In 2018, the northern terminus will be moved to the M4 south of Stupino.", "chunk_id": "52585d7d35bf885c", "doc_id": "hp_72463d3d08feec19"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_72463d3d08feec19"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="El Porfiriato">
  <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "El Porfiriato represents the reign of Porfirio Díaz as dictator in Mexico.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Film became popular and well known in Mexico during “El Porfiriato” which represents the reign of Porfirio Díaz as dictator in Mexico.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Porfirio Díaz">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Porfirio Díaz was a dictator in Mexico.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Film became popular and well known in Mexico during “El Porfiriato” which represents the reign of Porfirio Díaz as dictator in Mexico.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Vistas">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Vistas were the first films released in Mexico starting August 6, 1896.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "On August 6, 1896 the first films began to be released and were called/known as “Vistas”.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Mexican Revolution">
  <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Mexican Revolution was projected to the public through film and served as a motivator for the film industry.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Another important aspect was the projection of the Mexican Revolution to the public through film.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="El Cine Sonoro">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "El Cine Sonoro translates to the cinema of sound, an era where sound was added to silent films.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "With the positive energy that the Mexico’s film industries was receiving, it began to evolve into “El Cine Sonoro” which translates to the cinema of sound.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="The Golden Age">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Golden Age is known as the height of Mexico's film industry post \"El Cine Sonoro\" and is considered one of the most successful eras in Mexican cinema history.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Mexico’s film industry takes its height post “El Cine Sonoro” to what is known as “The Golden Age”.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Raul De Anda">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Raul De Anda is one of the most influential directors and actors of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Some of the most influential directors and actors are Emilio Fernández, Raul De Anda, Roberto B. Cervenna, Cantinflas, Vitola, Tin Tan, etc.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Roberto B. Cervenna">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Roberto B. Cervenna is one of the most influential directors and actors of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Some of the most influential directors and actors are Emilio Fernández, Raul De Anda, Roberto B. Cervenna, Cantinflas, Vitola, Tin Tan, etc.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Cantinflas">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Cantinflas is a top-grossing comedian actor of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Some of the most influential directors and actors are Emilio Fernández, Raul De Anda, Roberto B. Cervenna, Cantinflas, Vitola, Tin Tan, etc.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Vitola">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Vitola is one of the most influential directors and actors of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Some of the most influential directors and actors are Emilio Fernández, Raul De Anda, Roberto B. Cervenna, Cantinflas, Vitola, Tin Tan, etc.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Tin Tan">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Tin Tan is a top-grossing comedian actor of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Some of the most influential directors and actors are Emilio Fernández, Raul De Anda, Roberto B. Cervenna, Cantinflas, Vitola, Tin Tan, etc.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Clavillazo">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Clavillazo is a top-grossing comedian actor of the Golden Age of Mexican cinema.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The focus of this article will be on some of top grossing comedian actors of the time Cantinflas, Tin Tan, Clavillazo and others.", "chunk_id": "15bc36547e2dd368", "doc_id": "hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_729cba8a7fa727ec"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Enkarterri">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque Country, Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Enkarterri (Spanish: \"Las Encartaciones\") is a comarca of the province of Biscay, in the Basque Country, Spain.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_73ee189aee60b299"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Balmaseda">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The administrative centre of Enkarterri.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Its administrative centre is Balmaseda.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_73ee189aee60b299"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="river Nervion">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A river that forms the eastern boundary of Enkarterri.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Enkarterri stretches from the river Nervion and the Estuary of Bilbao in the east to the mountains that form its southern border with Cantabria and Castile-Leon in the west and south.", "chunk_id": "f62cc3566a0b0ee0", "doc_id": "hp_73ee189aee60b299"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_73ee189aee60b299"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
