<node id="Sydney">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Andrea Perego lived in Sydney.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}, {"text": "The city where October Rage opened for Bon Jovi.", "chunk_id": "c598b20051280564", "doc_id": "hp_d6f470ddf3a3421c"}, {"text": "It is located on the Mid North Coast of New South Wales, Australia, about 390 km north of Sydney, and 570 km south of Brisbane.", "chunk_id": "6223f89935ee9cfe", "doc_id": "hp_de00d7ebc47399cc"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "After living in Sydney, he is now working on projects in Venice and Berlin.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}, {"text": "They were winners in a songwriting competition for Sydney's TrippleM radio station in 2010 and won the opportunity to open for Bon Jovi in Sydney.", "chunk_id": "c598b20051280564", "doc_id": "hp_d6f470ddf3a3421c"}, {"text": "It is located on the Mid North Coast of New South Wales, Australia, about 390 km north of Sydney, and 570 km south of Brisbane.", "chunk_id": "6223f89935ee9cfe", "doc_id": "hp_de00d7ebc47399cc"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98", "hp_d6f470ddf3a3421c", "hp_de00d7ebc47399cc"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Venice">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Andrea Perego is now working on projects in Venice.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "After living in Sydney, he is now working on projects in Venice and Berlin.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Berlin">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Andrea Perego is now working on projects in Berlin.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}, {"text": "Berlin is the city where Fran Healy is based.", "chunk_id": "b495da896345a856", "doc_id": "hp_8e3f3120ae8497a2"}, {"text": "Berlin is a city in Germany, mentioned in comparison to the age of the Hoch Conservatory.", "chunk_id": "43c8b1224e31b404", "doc_id": "hp_a82ec9e667a313c7"}, {"text": "A city where the album Wreckorder was recorded.", "chunk_id": "02e94c52db8f837e", "doc_id": "hp_d73d23b34d64cf3a"}, {"text": "The city where Bellevue Palace is located.", "chunk_id": "ff48931294984b0c", "doc_id": "hp_dcebc5f0fd364ecc"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "After living in Sydney, he is now working on projects in Venice and Berlin.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}, {"text": "He is based in Berlin.", "chunk_id": "b495da896345a856", "doc_id": "hp_8e3f3120ae8497a2"}, {"text": "It is, after Leipzig and Berlin, the seventh oldest music conservatory in Germany.", "chunk_id": "43c8b1224e31b404", "doc_id": "hp_a82ec9e667a313c7"}, {"text": "The album was recorded in late 2009 in Berlin and New York City, before being completed in Vermont in early 2010.", "chunk_id": "02e94c52db8f837e", "doc_id": "hp_d73d23b34d64cf3a"}, {"text": "President Richard von Weizsäcker made Bellevue Palace in Berlin his primary official seat and residence in 1994.", "chunk_id": "ff48931294984b0c", "doc_id": "hp_dcebc5f0fd364ecc"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98", "hp_8e3f3120ae8497a2", "hp_a82ec9e667a313c7", "hp_d73d23b34d64cf3a", "hp_dcebc5f0fd364ecc"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="SBS Radio">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Andrea Perego worked as a broadcaster for SBS Radio in Australia.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In Australia he worked as a broadcaster for SBS Radio, doing reports that had wide resonance, such as the one about the murder of two Swiss Guards in the Vatican.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="murder of two Swiss Guards in the Vatican">
  <data key="d0">EVENT</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Andrea Perego did reports about the murder of two Swiss Guards in the Vatican.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In Australia he worked as a broadcaster for SBS Radio, doing reports that had wide resonance, such as the one about the murder of two Swiss Guards in the Vatican.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Vatican">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The murder of two Swiss Guards occurred in the Vatican.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In Australia he worked as a broadcaster for SBS Radio, doing reports that had wide resonance, such as the one about the murder of two Swiss Guards in the Vatican.", "chunk_id": "a005ee5e6658f2c6", "doc_id": "hp_8dc0bafcecb1ab98"}]</data>
