<node id="Distinguished Business Leader Award">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Distinguished Business Leader Award is an entrepreneurship award received by Gajendra Singh Sareen.", "chunk_id": "e133f6d50efcfbac", "doc_id": "hp_90e4cdc4e01bfe58"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He founded Omni United in 2003 and has since received numerous entrepreneurship awards including \"Distinguished Business Leader Award\", \"DBS Insignia Spirit of Vision Prestige Award\" and in 2012 was named to Fortune magazine's list of \"Asia's Hottest People in Business\".", "chunk_id": "e133f6d50efcfbac", "doc_id": "hp_90e4cdc4e01bfe58"}]</data>
