<node id="Vagrant Records">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Vagrant Records is the record label on which Aaron Embry released his solo album \"Tiny Prayers\".", "chunk_id": "35b4acf5c74b48d4", "doc_id": "hp_995e15f7f8919993"}, {"text": "A record label that released the album.", "chunk_id": "8fa693f0549c8311", "doc_id": "hp_f1ec6c8b9136d77b"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In 2012 he released his solo album \"Tiny Prayers\" on Vagrant Records.", "chunk_id": "35b4acf5c74b48d4", "doc_id": "hp_995e15f7f8919993"}, {"text": "It was released on July 23, 2013 in North America and was released on July 29, 2013 around the world through Vagrant Records, Rough Trade Records and Communion Records.", "chunk_id": "8fa693f0549c8311", "doc_id": "hp_f1ec6c8b9136d77b"}]</data>
