<node id="Bruce Weber">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A photographer who captured Michael Jackson for the 25th anniversary reissue of 'Thriller'.", "chunk_id": "824fceecb23d14cd", "doc_id": "hp_a2704beb739d6738"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In September of that year, photographer Bruce Weber and \"Vogue\" fashion editor as well as Jackson's personal stylist Rushka Bergman captured the magic of the King of Pop for the 25th anniversary reissue of his hit album \"Thriller\", entitled \"Thriller 25\".", "chunk_id": "824fceecb23d14cd", "doc_id": "hp_a2704beb739d6738"}]</data>
