<node id="Mount Yandang">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A specific part of the North Yandang around an ancient caldera, also referred to as Yandangshan in a narrower sense.", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "More narrowly, Yandangshan is also used more narrowly to refer to Mount Yandang , a specific part of the North Yandang around an ancient caldera near a small town of the same name (雁荡镇 , \"Yàndàng Zhèn\").", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_a71b119b261e3b26"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="ancient caldera">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A geological feature located in the North Yandang, around which Mount Yandang is situated.", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "More narrowly, Yandangshan is also used more narrowly to refer to Mount Yandang , a specific part of the North Yandang around an ancient caldera near a small town of the same name (雁荡镇 , \"Yàndàng Zhèn\").", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_a71b119b261e3b26"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Yandang Town">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A small town located near an ancient caldera in the North Yandang.", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "More narrowly, Yandangshan is also used more narrowly to refer to Mount Yandang , a specific part of the North Yandang around an ancient caldera near a small town of the same name (雁荡镇 , \"Yàndàng Zhèn\").", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_a71b119b261e3b26"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Mt. Yandang">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Refers to the ancient caldera in the North Yandang, as distinguished from the broader mountain range.", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In this article, name \"Yandang Mountains\" is used to refer the mountain range and \"Mt. Yandang\" to refer to the caldera.", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_a71b119b261e3b26"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Sheffield">
  <data key="d0">LOCATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Sheffield is a city in South Yorkshire, England.", "chunk_id": "7ad43fdb3c803322", "doc_id": "hp_a76877312504b02e"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "High Street is one of the main thoroughfares and shopping areas in the city centre of Sheffield in South Yorkshire, England, located at the approximate grid reference of [ SK356874] .", "chunk_id": "7ad43fdb3c803322", "doc_id": "hp_a76877312504b02e"}]</data>
