<node id="Dark Horse Comics">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The publisher of the \"Serenity\" comic book series, including \"Those Left Behind\".", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "\"Those Left Behind\" was popular: the first issue was the highest-selling comic published by Dark Horse Comics since the release of \"Buffy Season 8\" in 2007, while the trade paperback is still one of the highest ranking items by sale quantity from that company.", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Buffy Season 8">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A comic book series whose release in 2007 marked a previous high for Dark Horse Comics' sales.", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "\"Those Left Behind\" was popular: the first issue was the highest-selling comic published by Dark Horse Comics since the release of \"Buffy Season 8\" in 2007, while the trade paperback is still one of the highest ranking items by sale quantity from that company.", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Better Days">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A second \"Serenity\" comic miniseries released in early 2008, set before \"Those Left Behind\" and centered around a heist.", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In early 2008, a second miniseries was released. Titled \"Better Days\", it was set before \"Those Left Behind\", with the storyline based around a heist that went in the characters' favor.", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Jim Krueger">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Writer of the one-shot \"Serenity\" comic titled \"The Other Half\".", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "In addition to the miniseries, a one-shot comic written by Jim Krueger and titled \"The Other Half\" was released in the August 2008 issue of \"Dark Horse Presents\".", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4"]</data>
