  <data key="d2">[{"text": "There are two breeds of Braque français, both from the south of France, the Braque français, type Gascogne (French Pointing Dog - Gascogne type, larger size) and the Braque français, type Pyrénées (French Pointing Dog - Pyrenean type, smaller size)", "chunk_id": "27ab68d978f43c6c", "doc_id": "hp_cdc7b0cc951d083b"}]</data>
