</node>
<node id="Robert Scorpio">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Robert Scorpio is the super spy ex-husband of Anna Devane.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Upon her introduction, Anna is revealed to be the super spy ex-wife of Robert Scorpio and romantic rival to his current wife, Holly Sutton.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_d4c39db8215c1516"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Holly Sutton">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Holly Sutton is the current wife of Robert Scorpio and romantic rival to Anna Devane.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Upon her introduction, Anna is revealed to be the super spy ex-wife of Robert Scorpio and romantic rival to his current wife, Holly Sutton.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_d4c39db8215c1516"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Duke Lavery">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Duke Lavery was a former mobster and romantic partner of Anna Devane.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Anna remained a prominent character in the series until 1992 due to her romantic pairings with Robert and former mobster, Duke Lavery.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_d4c39db8215c1516"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Jerome family">
  <data key="d0">OTHER</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The Jerome family is a family associated with criminal pasts.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The storyline in which Duke tries to evade his criminal past with the Jerome family, allows for Duke and Anna to become one of the show's supercouples, along with Robert and Anna.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_d4c39db8215c1516"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Robin">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Robin is the daughter of Anna Devane and Robert Scorpio.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Robert and Anna eventually reunite to raise their daughter, Robin, and eventually remarry; the happiness is short lived and the duo are killed off in 1992 along with their rival, Cesar Faison.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_d4c39db8215c1516"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Cesar Faison">
  <data key="d0">PERSON</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "Cesar Faison was a rival to Anna Devane and Robert Scorpio.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Robert and Anna eventually reunite to raise their daughter, Robin, and eventually remarry; the happiness is short lived and the duo are killed off in 1992 along with their rival, Cesar Faison.", "chunk_id": "810ab9175e7a3cff", "doc_id": "hp_d4c39db8215c1516"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_d4c39db8215c1516"]</data>
  <data key="d4">False</data>
</node>
<node id="Pizza of Death Records">
  <data key="d0">ORGANIZATION</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "A Japanese record label based in Tokyo, Japan.", "chunk_id": "7fcbe97a0e441ab4", "doc_id": "hp_d534800743a3d491"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Pizza of Death is a Japanese record label based in Tokyo, Japan, and was founded by Hi-Standard front man Ken Yokoyama.", "chunk_id": "7fcbe97a0e441ab4", "doc_id": "hp_d534800743a3d491"}]</data>
  <data key="d3">["hp_d534800743a3d491"]</data>
