  <data key="d2">[{"text": "He is the founder of Mutant Enemy Productions and co-founder of Bellwether Pictures, and is best known as the creator of the television series \"Buffy the Vampire Slayer\" (1997–2003), \"Angel\" (1999–2004), \"Firefly\" (2002), \"Dollhouse\" (2009–10) and \"Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.\" (from 2013).", "chunk_id": "21e926e08f92273a", "doc_id": "hp_e70ef6817d0ab0fa"}]</data>
