  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Over his career, he won 3 Silver Ariel awards - the Mexican equivalent of the Oscar - including one for what is arguably his best-known role, playing Friday in Luis Buñuel's \"Robinson Crusoe\".", "chunk_id": "5caaa82e915cbb20", "doc_id": "hp_f4a1d9afa0828a54"}]</data>
