  <data key="d1">[{"text": "The largest oil producer among NOC's subsidiaries.", "chunk_id": "3bd8bdbee13ce970", "doc_id": "hp_f5e542612484aad3"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "Of NOC's subsidiaries, the largest oil producer is the Waha Oil Company (WOC), followed by the Arabian Gulf Oil Company (Agoco), Zueitina Oil Company (ZOC), and Sirte Oil Company (SOC).", "chunk_id": "3bd8bdbee13ce970", "doc_id": "hp_f5e542612484aad3"}]</data>
