  <data key="d6">Leonard Fein co-founded Moment magazine.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"Moment\" was founded in 1975, by Nobel Prize laureate Elie Wiesel and Jewish activist Leonard Fein, who served as the magazine's first editor from 1975 to 1987.", "chunk_id": "7156f0efb6184faa", "doc_id": "hp_02c3149273f48869", "type": "FOUNDED_BY"}, {"text": "\"Moment\" was founded in 1975, by Nobel Prize laureate Elie Wiesel and Jewish activist Leonard Fein, who served as the magazine's first editor from 1975 to 1987.", "chunk_id": "7156f0efb6184faa", "doc_id": "hp_02c3149273f48869", "type": "EDITOR_OF"}]</data>
