<edge source="No Light, No Light" target="UK Singles Chart">
  <data key="d5">["CHARTED_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The song No Light, No Light charted at number fifty on the UK Singles Chart.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The song peaked at number fifty on the UK Singles Chart, the Irish Singles Chart and number thirty nine on the US \"Billboard\" Alternative Songs chart.", "chunk_id": "eacf230036b80618", "doc_id": "hp_099c2da4a99b4f6f", "type": "CHARTED_ON"}]</data>
