  <data key="d6">Florence and the Machine was promoted as part of BBC Introducing.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The band's music received praise across the media, especially from the BBC, which played a large part in their rise to prominence by promoting Florence and the Machine as part of \"BBC Introducing\".", "chunk_id": "a0e37e5744f28418", "doc_id": "hp_6d4a91fc9052bf4e", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_6d4a91fc9052bf4e</data>
</edge>
