  <data key="d6">Florence and the Machine is the band that released the album Ceremonials.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"What the Water Gave Me\" is a song by English indie rock band Florence and the Machine from their second studio album \"Ceremonials\" (2011).", "chunk_id": "4a33b3fb6c1ee1fa", "doc_id": "hp_7804b34667739a36", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_7804b34667739a36</data>
