<edge source="Jacques Demy" target="Lola">
  <data key="d5">["DIRECTED", "DIRECTED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Jacques Demy directed the film Lola.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Lola, is a 1961 romantic drama film, the debut film directed by Jacques Demy as a tribute to director Max Ophüls and is described by Demy as a \"musical without music\".", "chunk_id": "f58d74090a79d846", "doc_id": "hp_231ed622feb34588", "type": "DIRECTED"}, {"text": "Aimée reprises the title role from Demy's 1960 French-language film \"Lola\".", "chunk_id": "3488ae8198c6ceab", "doc_id": "hp_654ac6630b014afb", "type": "DIRECTED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_231ed622feb34588</data>
</edge>
