<edge source="Jacques Demy" target="The Umbrellas of Cherbourg">
  <data key="d5">["DIRECTED", "DIRECTED", "DIRECTED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Jacques Demy directed the musical 'The Umbrellas of Cherbourg'.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "He is best known for the two musicals he directed in the mid-1960s: \"The Umbrellas of Cherbourg\" (1964) and \"The Young Girls of Rochefort\" (1967).", "chunk_id": "27dd0cc4171a09f6", "doc_id": "hp_4627d420baa4b1fd", "type": "DIRECTED"}, {"text": "Demy made \"Model Shop\", which was his first English-language film, following the international success of his film, \"The Umbrellas of Cherbourg\".", "chunk_id": "3488ae8198c6ceab", "doc_id": "hp_654ac6630b014afb", "type": "DIRECTED"}, {"text": "Like Demy's most famous film, \"The Umbrellas of Cherbourg\", it is an operetta-musical in which every line of dialogue is sung.", "chunk_id": "79ecca5757e35f6c", "doc_id": "hp_a7f67f1b79caebb6", "type": "DIRECTED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4627d420baa4b1fd</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Jacques Demy" target="The Young Girls of Rochefort">
  <data key="d5">["DIRECTED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Jacques Demy directed the musical 'The Young Girls of Rochefort'.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "He is best known for the two musicals he directed in the mid-1960s: \"The Umbrellas of Cherbourg\" (1964) and \"The Young Girls of Rochefort\" (1967).", "chunk_id": "27dd0cc4171a09f6", "doc_id": "hp_4627d420baa4b1fd", "type": "DIRECTED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4627d420baa4b1fd</data>
</edge>
