<edge source="Ogier the Dane" target="chanson de geste">
  <data key="d5">["APPEARS_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ogier the Dane first appears in an Old French chanson de geste.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ogier the Dane (French: \"Ogier le Danois\" or archaically \"Ogier de Danemarche\", Danish: \"Holger Danske\") is a legendary character who first appears in an Old French \"chanson de geste\", in the cycle of poems \"Geste de Doon de Mayence\".", "chunk_id": "707fa67e1952a89d", "doc_id": "hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb", "type": "APPEARS_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ogier the Dane" target="chansons de geste">
  <data key="d5">["APPEARS_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ogier the Dane appears in medieval chansons de geste.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Holger Danske, or Ogier the Dane, is a legendary character appearing in medieval chansons de geste.", "chunk_id": "b3a9c00150a552e2", "doc_id": "hp_b4f3b2a3a6af0d4a", "type": "APPEARS_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b4f3b2a3a6af0d4a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ogier le Danois" target="Ogier the Dane">
  <data key="d5">["ALIASES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ogier le Danois is a French name for Ogier the Dane.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ogier the Dane (French: \"Ogier le Danois\" or archaically \"Ogier de Danemarche\", Danish: \"Holger Danske\") is a legendary character who first appears in an Old French \"chanson de geste\", in the cycle of poems \"Geste de Doon de Mayence\".", "chunk_id": "707fa67e1952a89d", "doc_id": "hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb", "type": "ALIASES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ogier de Danemarche" target="Ogier the Dane">
  <data key="d5">["ALIASES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ogier de Danemarche is an archaic French name for Ogier the Dane.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ogier the Dane (French: \"Ogier le Danois\" or archaically \"Ogier de Danemarche\", Danish: \"Holger Danske\") is a legendary character who first appears in an Old French \"chanson de geste\", in the cycle of poems \"Geste de Doon de Mayence\".", "chunk_id": "707fa67e1952a89d", "doc_id": "hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb", "type": "ALIASES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Holger Danske" target="Ogier the Dane">
  <data key="d5">["ALIASES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Holger Danske is the Danish name for Ogier the Dane.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ogier the Dane (French: \"Ogier le Danois\" or archaically \"Ogier de Danemarche\", Danish: \"Holger Danske\") is a legendary character who first appears in an Old French \"chanson de geste\", in the cycle of poems \"Geste de Doon de Mayence\".", "chunk_id": "707fa67e1952a89d", "doc_id": "hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb", "type": "ALIASES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Holger Danske" target="chansons de geste">
  <data key="d5">["APPEARS_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Holger Danske appears in medieval chansons de geste.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Holger Danske, or Ogier the Dane, is a legendary character appearing in medieval chansons de geste.", "chunk_id": "b3a9c00150a552e2", "doc_id": "hp_b4f3b2a3a6af0d4a", "type": "APPEARS_IN"}]</data>
