</edge>
<edge source="chanson de geste" target="Geste de Doon de Mayence">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The chanson de geste is part of the cycle of poems known as Geste de Doon de Mayence.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ogier the Dane (French: \"Ogier le Danois\" or archaically \"Ogier de Danemarche\", Danish: \"Holger Danske\") is a legendary character who first appears in an Old French \"chanson de geste\", in the cycle of poems \"Geste de Doon de Mayence\".", "chunk_id": "707fa67e1952a89d", "doc_id": "hp_0ab939b45e2f3fdb", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
