  <data key="d6">Sugar Ray started off as a funk metal band.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The band, starting off more as a funk metal band, gained mainstream fame in 1997 with their release of the song \"Fly\".", "chunk_id": "ca10670f4e9a955b", "doc_id": "hp_5682f3a022ba8ac2", "type": "STARTED_AS"}]</data>
