<edge source="Warroad Lakers" target="Manitoba AHA">
  <data key="d5">["PLAYED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Warroad Lakers played in the Manitoba AHA league.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Lakers played in various Manitoba AHA and Thunder Bay AHA senior and intermediate leagues and were granted special eligibility for the Allan Cup and Hardy Cup by the Canadian Amateur Hockey Association.", "chunk_id": "ddf0ad92d8d0e27f", "doc_id": "hp_0c2bb267ca87242e", "type": "PLAYED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_0c2bb267ca87242e</data>
</edge>
