<edge source="Alice in Chains" target="Black Gives Way to Blue">
  <data key="d5">["PREVIOUS_ALBUM", "RELEASED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">'Black Gives Way to Blue' was the previous album by Alice in Chains.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Following a worldwide tour in support of its previous album, \"Black Gives Way to Blue\" (2009), Alice in Chains began work on a new album.", "chunk_id": "ac14247b71085709", "doc_id": "hp_0c8c04014969d68b", "type": "PREVIOUS_ALBUM"}, {"text": "Black Gives Way to Blue is the fourth studio album by the American rock band Alice in Chains, released in September 29, 2009.", "chunk_id": "a02521ae2928a8dd", "doc_id": "hp_7e9f73906e63aaa8", "type": "RELEASED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_0c8c04014969d68b</data>
</edge>
