  <data key="d6">No Excuses was a previous hit song by Alice in Chains on the Hot Mainstream Rock Tracks chart.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "This was the first time an Alice in Chains song would hit #1 on the Hot Mainstream Rock Tracks chart since their 1994 single \"No Excuses\".", "chunk_id": "0ab7d428406248fd", "doc_id": "hp_62d25a1f81638a35", "type": "PREVIOUS_HIT_SONG"}]</data>
