<edge source="All-American Strongman Challenge" target="World's Strongest Man">
  <data key="d5">["RELATED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Finalists of the World's Strongest Man competition are often represented in the All-American Strongman Challenge.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It is notable for the calibre of entrants it has attracted, with many World's Strongest Man finalists being represented.", "chunk_id": "fb43fe49d9c01907", "doc_id": "hp_1183c20fecf2a891", "type": "RELATED_TO"}]</data>
