  <data key="d6">British troops defeated French troops during the Battle of Morne de la Vierge.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "During the Battle of St. Lucia the British fleet defeated a French fleet sent to reinforced the island, and a few days later French troops were soundly defeated by British troops during the Battle of Morne de la Vierge.", "chunk_id": "8523c82e4a1e2345", "doc_id": "hp_11c2671edfb8f605", "type": "DEFEATED"}]</data>
