<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="Otoka">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Istiklal Mosque is located in Otoka.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Istiqlal Mosque, or Masjid Istiqlal, (Independence Mosque) in Otoka, Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina is one of the largest mosques in the city.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="Sarajevo">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Istiklal Mosque is located in Sarajevo.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Istiqlal Mosque, or Masjid Istiqlal, (Independence Mosque) in Otoka, Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina is one of the largest mosques in the city.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="Bosnia and Herzegovina">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN", "TOKEN_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Istiklal Mosque is located in Bosnia and Herzegovina.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Istiqlal Mosque, or Masjid Istiqlal, (Independence Mosque) in Otoka, Sarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina is one of the largest mosques in the city.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}, {"text": "It was named after Istiqlal Mosque, Jakarta, the national mosque of Indonesia, since the mosque was the gift from Indonesian people and government for Bosnia and Herzegovina as a token of solidarity and friendship between two nations.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "TOKEN_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="Istiklal Mosque, Jakarta">
  <data key="d5">["NAMED_AFTER"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Istiklal Mosque in Sarajevo was named after Istiklal Mosque in Jakarta.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was named after Istiqlal Mosque, Jakarta, the national mosque of Indonesia, since the mosque was the gift from Indonesian people and government for Bosnia and Herzegovina as a token of solidarity and friendship between two nations.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "NAMED_AFTER"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="Indonesian people and government">
  <data key="d5">["GIFTED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Istiklal Mosque in Sarajevo was a gift from the Indonesian people and government.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was named after Istiqlal Mosque, Jakarta, the national mosque of Indonesia, since the mosque was the gift from Indonesian people and government for Bosnia and Herzegovina as a token of solidarity and friendship between two nations.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "GIFTED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="independence">
  <data key="d5">["COMMEMORATES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Istiklal Mosque in Sarajevo is meant to commemorate the independence of Bosnia and Herzegovina.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The name \"istiqlal\" is Arabic word for \"independence\", thus it is also meant to commemorate the independence of Bosnia and Herzegovina.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "COMMEMORATES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="Indonesian mosque">
  <data key="d5">["HAS_COLLOQUIAL_NAME"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Istiklal Mosque is colloquially known as 'Indonesian mosque'.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It is also colloquially known as \"Indonesian mosque\" or \"Suharto mosque\", as the credit to the initiator of the mosque construction.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "HAS_COLLOQUIAL_NAME"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque" target="Suharto mosque">
  <data key="d5">["HAS_COLLOQUIAL_NAME"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Istiklal Mosque is colloquially known as 'Suharto mosque'.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It is also colloquially known as \"Indonesian mosque\" or \"Suharto mosque\", as the credit to the initiator of the mosque construction.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "HAS_COLLOQUIAL_NAME"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Istiklal Mosque, Jakarta" target="Indonesia">
  <data key="d5">["IS_NATIONAL_MOSQUE_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Istiklal Mosque, Jakarta is the national mosque of Indonesia.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was named after Istiqlal Mosque, Jakarta, the national mosque of Indonesia, since the mosque was the gift from Indonesian people and government for Bosnia and Herzegovina as a token of solidarity and friendship between two nations.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "IS_NATIONAL_MOSQUE_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
<edge source="istiqlal" target="independence">
  <data key="d5">["MEANS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Arabic word 'istiqlal' means 'independence'.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The name \"istiqlal\" is Arabic word for \"independence\", thus it is also meant to commemorate the independence of Bosnia and Herzegovina.", "chunk_id": "1cbf4009842f5c2b", "doc_id": "hp_1228d503d45e5b99", "type": "MEANS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1228d503d45e5b99</data>
</edge>
