<edge source="Ratt" target="Out of the Cellar">
  <data key="d5">["RELEASED", "RELEASED_ALBUM"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ratt released the album "Out of the Cellar".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"Wanted Man' is the first track on American heavy metal band Ratt's album \"Out of the Cellar\".", "chunk_id": "1c9e0b6104c2f63d", "doc_id": "hp_7dbc7d21f7c51f32", "type": "RELEASED"}, {"text": "He co-wrote the song \"Back For More\" with Stephen Pearcy on Ratt's album \"Out of the Cellar\".", "chunk_id": "69ea2310084e6973", "doc_id": "hp_b786bea89d57e8fa", "type": "RELEASED_ALBUM"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_7dbc7d21f7c51f32</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Stephen Pearcy" target="Ratt">
  <data key="d5">["WORKS_AT", "FOUNDED_BY", "MEMBER_OF", "FORMER_MEMBER_OF", "MEMBER_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Stephen Pearcy is the vocalist for the band Ratt.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was written by Ratt vocalist Stephen Pearcy, bassist Juan Croucier, and guitarist Warren DeMartini.", "chunk_id": "4e0b38de0e3e7000", "doc_id": "hp_12b49066ad532acc", "type": "WORKS_AT"}, {"text": "He is best known as the founder, singer, and songwriter of the heavy metal band Ratt.", "chunk_id": "a5a1a3ab9a01f805", "doc_id": "hp_2a3d8bb73905c462", "type": "FOUNDED_BY"}, {"text": "The song was co-written by Ratt bassist Juan Croucier, guitarist Warren DeMartini, lead singer Stephen Pearcy and songwriter Desmond Child.", "chunk_id": "66ad2e860f938fc7", "doc_id": "hp_58add9e266f469f0", "type": "MEMBER_OF"}, {"text": "Stephen Pearcy was said to still be in his Ratt form, indeed his voice was just as compelling.", "chunk_id": "8efa335de18f3d03", "doc_id": "hp_810b9dfd1db699c1", "type": "FORMER_MEMBER_OF"}, {"text": "The song was co-written by famed songwriter Desmond Child, Ratt guitarist Warren DeMartini and lead singer Stephen Pearcy.", "chunk_id": "6320f732c14ef885", "doc_id": "hp_95b0346082b5ad8e", "type": "MEMBER_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_12b49066ad532acc</data>
</edge>
