  <data key="d6">Bonifacio High Street South is also known as High Street South.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Currently, the mall has four sections, the first and second blocks are an open-air shopping, while the third block is a mixture of open-air and indoor commercial buildings dubbed as the Bonifacio High Street Central and the fourth block which was named Bonifacio High Street South or simply High Street South in which is a mixture of open-air and indoor commercial-residential buildings.", "chunk_id": "851db6962c10e795", "doc_id": "hp_13b0e7c83e58b31d", "type": "IS_ALIAS_OF"}]</data>
