<edge source="Raj Kapoor" target="Ram Teri Ganga Maili">
  <data key="d5">["DIRECTED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Raj Kapoor directed the film Ram Teri Ganga Maili.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ram Teri Ganga Maili (literal translation: \"Ram, Your Ganga's Become Impure\") is a 1985 Bollywood film directed by actor-director Raj Kapoor.", "chunk_id": "9587b01bee29deed", "doc_id": "hp_153a2c475bfeef6e", "type": "DIRECTED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_153a2c475bfeef6e</data>
