<edge source="Port Macquarie-Hastings Council" target="Glasshouse">
  <data key="d5">["INITIATED_BY", "FUNDED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Port Macquarie-Hastings Council initiated the project to build the Glasshouse.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The dismissal of the Port Macquarie-Hastings Council on 27 February 2008 marked the end of a series of events involving a project which was initiated in 2001 in the New South Wales coastal town of Port Macquarie to build a cultural and entertainment centre, known to locals as the Glasshouse.", "chunk_id": "203bcd26d9746ba7", "doc_id": "hp_d399c5634a0f3001", "type": "INITIATED_BY"}, {"text": "The project, initially a joint venture with the management of the neighbouring shopping centre, Port Central, was originally expected to cost the Council A$ 7.3 million.", "chunk_id": "203bcd26d9746ba7", "doc_id": "hp_d399c5634a0f3001", "type": "FUNDED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_d399c5634a0f3001</data>
</edge>
