<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="Raj Kapoor">
  <data key="d5">["DIRECTED_BY", "BASED_ON", "FAVORITE_FILM_OF", "FINEST_WORKS_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Raj Kapoor directed the film "Mera Naam Joker".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Mera Naam Joker (translation: \"My Name is Joker\") is a 1970 Indian Hindi drama film directed by Raj Kapoor.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "DIRECTED_BY"}, {"text": "After \"Sangam\" became a blockbuster, \"Mera Naam Joker\" was highly anticipated as it was under production for six years and was heavily publicized to be loosely based on Raj Kapoor's own life.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "BASED_ON"}, {"text": "Raj Kapoor termed this his favorite film and described it as having deep philosophical depth and meaning.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "FAVORITE_FILM_OF"}, {"text": "The film is regarded as one of Kapoor's finest works today with film experts labeling it as a 'misunderstood masterpiece'.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "FINEST_WORKS_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="Khwaja Ahmad Abbas">
  <data key="d5">["WRITTEN_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Khwaja Ahmad Abbas wrote the screenplay for "Mera Naam Joker".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The screenplay was written by Khwaja Ahmad Abbas.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "WRITTEN_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="Rishi Kapoor">
  <data key="d5">["DEBUT_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The film "Mera Naam Joker" was the debut of Rishi Kapoor.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "This film was the debut of Rishi Kapoor.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "DEBUT_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="Indian cinema">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">"Mera Naam Joker" is considered one of the lengthiest films of Indian cinema.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The film is considered to be one of the lengthiest films of Indian cinema.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="Sangam">
  <data key="d5">["PREDECESSOR_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">After "Sangam" became a blockbuster, "Mera Naam Joker" was highly anticipated.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "After \"Sangam\" became a blockbuster, \"Mera Naam Joker\" was highly anticipated as it was under production for six years and was heavily publicized to be loosely based on Raj Kapoor's own life.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "PREDECESSOR_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="financial crisis">
  <data key="d5">["RESULTED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The film's critical and commercial disaster put Kapoor into a financial crisis.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Upon release the film turned out to be a critical and commercial disaster putting Kapoor into a financial crisis.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "RESULTED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="cult status">
  <data key="d5">["GAINED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Over the years, the film "Mera Naam Joker" has gained a cult status.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "However, over the years, the film has gained a cult status and is regarded as a classic today.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "GAINED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Mera Naam Joker" target="classic">
  <data key="d5">["REGARDED_AS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The film "Mera Naam Joker" is regarded as a classic today.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "However, over the years, the film has gained a cult status and is regarded as a classic today.", "chunk_id": "a1abbeeae15652d0", "doc_id": "hp_147900705f372e86", "type": "REGARDED_AS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_147900705f372e86</data>
