<edge source="África de las Heras" target="Ceuta">
  <data key="d5">["BORN_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">África de las Heras was born in Ceuta.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "África de las Heras Gavilán (Ceuta, 26 April 1909 – Moscow, 8 March 1988) was a Spanish Communist, naturalized Soviet citizen, and KGB Spy who went by the code name \"Patria\", but also used the names \"María Luisa de las Heras de Darbat\",\"María de la Sierra\",\"Patricia\", \"Ivonne\", \"María de las Heras\", \"Znoi\" and \"María Pavlovna\".", "chunk_id": "9c96657c56b59858", "doc_id": "hp_16186a29c9da8f74", "type": "BORN_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_16186a29c9da8f74</data>
</edge>
