<edge source="Michael Jackson" target="This Is It (Michael Jackson song)">
  <data key="d5">["CO_WROTE", "DEMO_VERSION_FOUND"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Michael Jackson co-wrote the song "This Is It".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"This Is It\" is a song co-written by American pop star and musician Michael Jackson and Canadian singer-songwriter Paul Anka.", "chunk_id": "8fc2541873625ab9", "doc_id": "hp_aba1d192473010be", "type": "CO_WROTE"}, {"text": "While putting together the \"This Is It\" album, Jackson's demo version of the song was found.", "chunk_id": "8fc2541873625ab9", "doc_id": "hp_aba1d192473010be", "type": "DEMO_VERSION_FOUND"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_aba1d192473010be</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Michael Jackson" target="This Is It (album)">
  <data key="d5">["HAS_TRACK"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The song "This Is It" was featured as a track on the album "This Is It".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The song was recorded by the former and featured as a track on the album, \"This Is It\" (2009), which accompanies the 2009 concert documentary \"Michael Jackson's This Is It\".", "chunk_id": "8fc2541873625ab9", "doc_id": "hp_aba1d192473010be", "type": "HAS_TRACK"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_aba1d192473010be</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Michael Jackson" target="Jackson's estate">
  <data key="d5">["IS_SUBJECT_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Michael Jackson died on June 25, 2009, and his estate was involved in legal actions regarding his song.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was premiered worldwide on Jackson's official website on October 12, 2009 four months after his death on June 25, 2009.", "chunk_id": "8fc2541873625ab9", "doc_id": "hp_aba1d192473010be", "type": "IS_SUBJECT_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_aba1d192473010be</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Michael Jackson" target="I Never Heard">
  <data key="d5">["WAS_TO_BE_DUET_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Michael Jackson was intended to perform a duet with Paul Anka on the song "I Never Heard".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "According to Anka, the song was recorded in 1983 and intended to be a duet between him and Jackson on Anka's \"Walk a Fine Line\" album under the title \"I Never Heard\", but these plans fell through.", "chunk_id": "8fc2541873625ab9", "doc_id": "hp_aba1d192473010be", "type": "WAS_TO_BE_DUET_ON"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_aba1d192473010be</data>
</edge>
