  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Neolithic period occurred in the Korean Peninsula.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The earliest known Korean pottery dates to around 8000 BC, and the Neolithic period began after 6000 BC, followed by the Bronze Age by 800 BC, and the Iron Age around 400 BC.", "chunk_id": "1aaf25b79d68fe30", "doc_id": "hp_1c48776465495288", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
