<edge source="James Burke" target="Connections">
  <data key="d5">["PRODUCED", "CREATED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">James Burke is known for his documentary television series "Connections".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "James Burke (born 22 December 1936) is a British broadcaster, science historian, author, and television producer, who is known, among other things, for his documentary television series \"Connections\" (1978), and for its more philosophically oriented companion series, \"The Day the Universe Changed\" (1985), which is about the history of science and technology.", "chunk_id": "d20f38d436444ac0", "doc_id": "hp_1fa56752c144bc40", "type": "PRODUCED"}, {"text": "Connections is a 10-episode documentary television series and 1978 book (\"Connections\", based on the series) created, written, and presented by science historian James Burke.", "chunk_id": "ff5da75d9754d424", "doc_id": "hp_83e4174eb0dec6ec", "type": "CREATED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1fa56752c144bc40</data>
</edge>
<edge source="James Burke" target="The Day the Universe Changed">
  <data key="d5">["PRODUCED", "CREATED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">James Burke is known for his companion series "The Day the Universe Changed".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "James Burke (born 22 December 1936) is a British broadcaster, science historian, author, and television producer, who is known, among other things, for his documentary television series \"Connections\" (1978), and for its more philosophically oriented companion series, \"The Day the Universe Changed\" (1985), which is about the history of science and technology.", "chunk_id": "d20f38d436444ac0", "doc_id": "hp_1fa56752c144bc40", "type": "PRODUCED"}, {"text": "The Day the Universe Changed: A Personal View by James Burke is a British documentary television series written and presented by science historian James Burke, originally broadcast on BBC1 from 19 March until 21 May 1985 by the BBC.", "chunk_id": "641da45da986e5ce", "doc_id": "hp_58b33fe59f58c1ed", "type": "CREATED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1fa56752c144bc40</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Connections" target="history of science and invention">
  <data key="d5">["APPROACHED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The "Connections" series took an interdisciplinary approach to the history of science and invention.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It took an interdisciplinary approach to the history of science and invention, and demonstrated how various discoveries, scientific achievements, and historical world events were built from one another successively in an interconnected way to bring about particular aspects of modern technology.", "chunk_id": "ff5da75d9754d424", "doc_id": "hp_83e4174eb0dec6ec", "type": "APPROACHED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_83e4174eb0dec6ec</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Connections" target="modern technology">
  <data key="d5">["DEMONSTRATED_RELATIONSHIP_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The "Connections" series demonstrated how discoveries and events led to aspects of modern technology.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It took an interdisciplinary approach to the history of science and invention, and demonstrated how various discoveries, scientific achievements, and historical world events were built from one another successively in an interconnected way to bring about particular aspects of modern technology.", "chunk_id": "ff5da75d9754d424", "doc_id": "hp_83e4174eb0dec6ec", "type": "DEMONSTRATED_RELATIONSHIP_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_83e4174eb0dec6ec</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Connections" target="James Burke">
  <data key="d5">["CREATED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The documentary series 'Connections' was created by James Burke in 1978.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The show's format is very similar to that of James Burke's 1978 documentary series, \"Connections\".", "chunk_id": "ec87e3591d7acc99", "doc_id": "hp_8429039f0ec9c01d", "type": "CREATED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8429039f0ec9c01d</data>
</edge>
<edge source="The Day the Universe Changed" target="Connections">
  <data key="d5">["COMPANION_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">"The Day the Universe Changed" is a companion series to "Connections".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "James Burke (born 22 December 1936) is a British broadcaster, science historian, author, and television producer, who is known, among other things, for his documentary television series \"Connections\" (1978), and for its more philosophically oriented companion series, \"The Day the Universe Changed\" (1985), which is about the history of science and technology.", "chunk_id": "d20f38d436444ac0", "doc_id": "hp_1fa56752c144bc40", "type": "COMPANION_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_1fa56752c144bc40</data>
</edge>
<edge source="The Day the Universe Changed" target="BBC1">
  <data key="d5">["BROADCAST_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The documentary series 'The Day the Universe Changed' was originally broadcast on BBC1.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Day the Universe Changed: A Personal View by James Burke is a British documentary television series written and presented by science historian James Burke, originally broadcast on BBC1 from 19 March until 21 May 1985 by the BBC.", "chunk_id": "641da45da986e5ce", "doc_id": "hp_58b33fe59f58c1ed", "type": "BROADCAST_ON"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_58b33fe59f58c1ed</data>
</edge>
