  <data key="d6">The documentary series 'The Day the Universe Changed' was originally broadcast by the BBC.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Day the Universe Changed: A Personal View by James Burke is a British documentary television series written and presented by science historian James Burke, originally broadcast on BBC1 from 19 March until 21 May 1985 by the BBC.", "chunk_id": "641da45da986e5ce", "doc_id": "hp_58b33fe59f58c1ed", "type": "BROADCAST_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_58b33fe59f58c1ed</data>
</edge>
<edge source="The Day the Universe Changed" target="science and technology">
  <data key="d5">["FOCUS_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The documentary series 'The Day the Universe Changed' focuses on the effect of advances in science and technology.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The series' primary focus is on the effect of advances in science and technology on western society in its philosophical aspects.", "chunk_id": "641da45da986e5ce", "doc_id": "hp_58b33fe59f58c1ed", "type": "FOCUS_ON"}]</data>
