<edge source="Honey, I Shrunk the Audience" target="Honey, I Shrunk the Kids">
  <data key="d5">["SPIN_OFF_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Honey, I Shrunk the Audience! is a spin-off of Honey, I Shrunk the Kids.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Marcia Ann Strassman (April 28, 1948\r\n\r\n– October 24, 2014) was an American actress and singer, best known for her roles as Nurse Margie Cutler on \"M*A*S*H\", as Julie Kotter on \"Welcome Back, Kotter\" and as Diane Szalinski in the feature film \"Honey, I Shrunk the Kids\" (1989); its sequel \"Honey, I Blew Up the Kid\" (1992); and the 3-D film spin-off \"Honey, I Shrunk the Audience!\" (1994), which was shown at several Disney theme parks through mid-2010.", "chunk_id": "3ee681daaaaf1d61", "doc_id": "hp_122377c2fa6d536d", "type": "SPIN_OFF_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_122377c2fa6d536d</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Honey, I Shrunk the Audience" target="Disney theme parks">
  <data key="d5">["SHOWN_AT"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Honey, I Shrunk the Audience! was shown at Disney theme parks.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Marcia Ann Strassman (April 28, 1948\r\n\r\n– October 24, 2014) was an American actress and singer, best known for her roles as Nurse Margie Cutler on \"M*A*S*H\", as Julie Kotter on \"Welcome Back, Kotter\" and as Diane Szalinski in the feature film \"Honey, I Shrunk the Kids\" (1989); its sequel \"Honey, I Blew Up the Kid\" (1992); and the 3-D film spin-off \"Honey, I Shrunk the Audience!\" (1994), which was shown at several Disney theme parks through mid-2010.", "chunk_id": "3ee681daaaaf1d61", "doc_id": "hp_122377c2fa6d536d", "type": "SHOWN_AT"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_122377c2fa6d536d</data>
</edge>
