  <data key="d6">The peanut is a species within the genus Arachis.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "At least one species, the peanut (\"Arachis hypogaea\"), is a major food crop species of global importance; some of the other species are cultivated for food to a small extent in South America.", "chunk_id": "ba034880e13d7dbd", "doc_id": "hp_259c900d1fad8746", "type": "IS_A"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_259c900d1fad8746</data>
</edge>
<edge source="A. pintoi" target="Arachis">
  <data key="d5">["IS_A"]</data>
  <data key="d6">A. pintoi is a species within the genus Arachis.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Other species such as \"A. pintoi\" are cultivated worldwide as forage and soil conditioner plants, with the leaves providing high-protein feed for grazing livestock and a nitrogen source in agroforestry and permaculture systems.", "chunk_id": "ba034880e13d7dbd", "doc_id": "hp_259c900d1fad8746", "type": "IS_A"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_259c900d1fad8746</data>
</edge>
