  <data key="d6">Thomas Blood attempted to steal the British Crown Jewels.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In reality, the only modern attempt to steal the Jewels was made in 1671 by Thomas Blood and his accomplices, who failed to escape — an earlier attempt in the early fourteenth century was equally unsuccessful — and the game challenges players to “succeed where they failed.”", "chunk_id": "00e6b97039cae14c", "doc_id": "hp_2921be96b466f689", "type": "ATTEMPTED_TO_STEAL"}]</data>
