  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Liriodendron tulipifera can grow in the Appalachian Mountains.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It can grow to more than 50 m in virgin cove forests of the Appalachian Mountains, often with no limbs until it reaches 25 – in height, making it a very valuable timber tree.", "chunk_id": "976ede3d58522907", "doc_id": "hp_2c1beb2f73cca8d4", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
