<edge source="Overtime (ice hockey)" target="overtime period">
  <data key="d5">["INCLUDES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Overtime (ice hockey) can be extended by an overtime period.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The two main methods of extending the game are the overtime period (commonly referred to as overtime) and the shootout.", "chunk_id": "2f0c7a6928ef44b4", "doc_id": "hp_2d53d1bdc10ca42f", "type": "INCLUDES"}]</data>
