  <data key="d6">Jorge Amado's work reflects the image of Mestiço Brazil.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "His work reflects the image of a Mestiço Brazil and is marked by religious syncretism.", "chunk_id": "6ab1b1b0f987ea76", "doc_id": "hp_f34261cdc3c2359c", "type": "REFLECTS"}]</data>
