<edge source="The Violent Land" target="literature of cacao">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Jorge Amado suggested that The Violent Land belongs to the Brazilian literature of cacao.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Amado wrote that \"No other of my books. . . is as dear to me as \"The Violent Land\", in it lie my roots; it is from the blood from which I was created; it contains the gunfire that resounded during my early infancy\", and suggested that the novel belongs to a distinct Brazilian \"literature of cacao\".", "chunk_id": "5b9d731909fa866e", "doc_id": "hp_3182b9b6096ed733", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_3182b9b6096ed733</data>
</edge>
