  <data key="d6">Stephen Halbrook wrote briefs pertaining to the Gun Control Act of 1968 in the case "Small v. United States".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "He has also written briefs in many other cases, including the Supreme Court cases \"Small v. United States\" (pertaining to the Gun Control Act of 1968) and \"McDonald v. Chicago\".", "chunk_id": "eab3a4e28ecc70cf", "doc_id": "hp_3196bc16ccdc716d", "type": "AUTHORED_BRIEFS_PERTAINING_TO"}]</data>
