  <data key="d7">[{"text": "However, in 2000, Jennifer Saunders had created and written a television pilot for a proposed upcoming new series, \"Mirrorball\" in which she intended to reunite the cast of \"Ab Fab\" in new character roles and a different plot.", "chunk_id": "2d1cd752b15a14fe", "doc_id": "hp_323aaf8fc4b0ff2c", "type": "REUNION_OF_CAST_OF"}]</data>
