<edge source="Joseon naval campaigns of 1592" target="Japanese invasions of Korea">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF", "OCCURRED_DURING", "USED_FOR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Joseon naval campaigns of 1592 were part of the larger Japanese invasions of Korea.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Joseon naval campaigns of 1592 was naval campaigns conducted by Korean admiral Yi Sun-sin during Japanese invasions of Korea (1592-1598) against the Japanese forces of Toyotomi Hideyoshi.", "chunk_id": "68610c0d374404f2", "doc_id": "hp_3358c15c20048369", "type": "PART_OF"}, {"text": "The Battle of Happo was a naval engagement on May 7, 1592, one of the three Joseon naval campaigns of 1592 conducted by Korean admiral Yi Sun-sin during Japanese invasions of Korea (1592-1598) against the Japanese forces of Toyotomi Hideyoshi.", "chunk_id": "bf39df43067a80b1", "doc_id": "hp_3a9829e8fd3b32c6", "type": "OCCURRED_DURING"}, {"text": "The campaigns of Yi were vital in halting the Japanese invasion.", "chunk_id": "bf39df43067a80b1", "doc_id": "hp_3a9829e8fd3b32c6", "type": "USED_FOR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_3358c15c20048369</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Joseon naval campaigns of 1592" target="Toyotomi Hideyoshi">
  <data key="d5">["AGAINST"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Joseon naval campaigns of 1592 were conducted against the Japanese forces of Toyotomi Hideyoshi.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Joseon naval campaigns of 1592 was naval campaigns conducted by Korean admiral Yi Sun-sin during Japanese invasions of Korea (1592-1598) against the Japanese forces of Toyotomi Hideyoshi.", "chunk_id": "68610c0d374404f2", "doc_id": "hp_3358c15c20048369", "type": "AGAINST"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_3358c15c20048369</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Joseon naval campaigns of 1592" target="Yi Sun-sin">
  <data key="d5">["CONDUCTED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Joseon naval campaigns of 1592 were conducted by Korean admiral Yi Sun-sin.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Battle of Happo was a naval engagement on May 7, 1592, one of the three Joseon naval campaigns of 1592 conducted by Korean admiral Yi Sun-sin during Japanese invasions of Korea (1592-1598) against the Japanese forces of Toyotomi Hideyoshi.", "chunk_id": "bf39df43067a80b1", "doc_id": "hp_3a9829e8fd3b32c6", "type": "CONDUCTED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_3a9829e8fd3b32c6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Toyotomi Hideyoshi" target="Japanese navy">
  <data key="d5">["ORDERED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Toyotomi Hideyoshi ordered the Japanese navy to avoid direct engagement with the Joseon navy.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "After Hansan-do Toyotomi Hideyoshi ordered the Japanese navy to avoid direct engagement with the Joseon navy and instead station itself in fortifications along the coast to defend important sea lands.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "ORDERED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
