  <data key="d6">The album Mötley Crüe features John Corabi as the vocalist.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Neil was replaced by former The Scream vocalist John Corabi on the album.", "chunk_id": "c57fbc208f9c8aea", "doc_id": "hp_3835f9a65d3f6cf8", "type": "FEATURES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_3835f9a65d3f6cf8</data>
