  <data key="d6">Manley Field House was home to teams before the Carrier Dome opened.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was home to the Syracuse Orange men's and women's basketball teams, the indoor track team, and the women's volleyball team before the Carrier Dome opened in 1980.", "chunk_id": "f2b57f4a59e6b366", "doc_id": "hp_3e92bdc5489290ce", "type": "SUCCESSOR_OF"}]</data>
