<edge source="Despoina" target="Demeter">
  <data key="d5">["DAUGHTER_OF", "ASSOCIATED_WITH"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Despoina was the daughter of Demeter.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In Greek mythology, Despoina, Despoena or Despoine, was the daughter of Demeter and Poseidon and sister of Arion.", "chunk_id": "e7a3b85aaae283b2", "doc_id": "hp_438860de5931a74b", "type": "DAUGHTER_OF"}, {"text": "She was the goddess of mysteries of Arcadian cults worshipped under the title \"Despoina\", \"the mistress\" alongside her mother Demeter, one of the goddesses of the Eleusinian mysteries.", "chunk_id": "e7a3b85aaae283b2", "doc_id": "hp_438860de5931a74b", "type": "ASSOCIATED_WITH"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_438860de5931a74b</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Despoina" target="Poseidon">
  <data key="d5">["DAUGHTER_OF", "DAUGHTER_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Despoina was the daughter of Poseidon.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In Greek mythology, Despoina, Despoena or Despoine, was the daughter of Demeter and Poseidon and sister of Arion.", "chunk_id": "e7a3b85aaae283b2", "doc_id": "hp_438860de5931a74b", "type": "DAUGHTER_OF"}, {"text": "With Zeus being the father of Kore, and Poseidon as the father of Despoina.", "chunk_id": "e7a3b85aaae283b2", "doc_id": "hp_438860de5931a74b", "type": "DAUGHTER_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_438860de5931a74b</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Despoina" target="Arion">
  <data key="d5">["SIBLING_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Despoina was the sister of Arion.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In Greek mythology, Despoina, Despoena or Despoine, was the daughter of Demeter and Poseidon and sister of Arion.", "chunk_id": "e7a3b85aaae283b2", "doc_id": "hp_438860de5931a74b", "type": "SIBLING_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_438860de5931a74b</data>
</edge>
