  <data key="d5">["LAST_VICTORY_IN_CAREER"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Battle of Ligny was the last victory in the military career of Napoleon Bonaparte.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Battle of Ligny (16 June 1815) was the last victory of the military career of Napoleon Bonaparte.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "LAST_VICTORY_IN_CAREER"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Armée du Nord" target="Napoleon Bonaparte">
  <data key="d5">["COMMANDED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Armée du Nord was under Napoleon's command.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In this battle, French troops of the Armée du Nord under Napoleon's command, defeated part of a Prussian army under Field Marshal Prince Blücher, near Ligny in present-day Belgium.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "COMMANDED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prussian army" target="Field Marshal Prince Blücher">
  <data key="d5">["COMMANDED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Part of the Prussian army was under the command of Field Marshal Prince Blücher.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In this battle, French troops of the Armée du Nord under Napoleon's command, defeated part of a Prussian army under Field Marshal Prince Blücher, near Ligny in present-day Belgium.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "COMMANDED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prussian army" target="Battle of Waterloo">
  <data key="d5">["PARTICIPATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Prussian army played a pivotal role at the Battle of Waterloo.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "While the French troops did force the enemy to retreat, the Prussian army survived and went on to play a pivotal role two days later at the Battle of Waterloo, reinforced by IV Prussian corps that had not participated in the battle at Ligny.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "PARTICIPATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Prussian army" target="Anglo-allied Army">
  <data key="d5">["COULD_HAVE_JOINED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Prussian army might have joined the Anglo-allied Army at Waterloo.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Had the French army succeeded in keeping the Prussian army from joining the Anglo-allied Army under Wellington at Waterloo, Napoleon might have won the Waterloo Campaign.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "COULD_HAVE_JOINED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
