  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ligny is located in present-day Belgium.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In this battle, French troops of the Armée du Nord under Napoleon's command, defeated part of a Prussian army under Field Marshal Prince Blücher, near Ligny in present-day Belgium.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="IV Prussian corps" target="Prussian army">
  <data key="d5">["REINFORCED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The IV Prussian corps reinforced the Prussian army at the Battle of Waterloo.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "While the French troops did force the enemy to retreat, the Prussian army survived and went on to play a pivotal role two days later at the Battle of Waterloo, reinforced by IV Prussian corps that had not participated in the battle at Ligny.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "REINFORCED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
