  <data key="d5">["DID_NOT_PARTICIPATE_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The IV Prussian corps had not participated in the battle at Ligny.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "While the French troops did force the enemy to retreat, the Prussian army survived and went on to play a pivotal role two days later at the Battle of Waterloo, reinforced by IV Prussian corps that had not participated in the battle at Ligny.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "DID_NOT_PARTICIPATE_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Anglo-allied Army" target="Wellington">
  <data key="d5">["COMMANDED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Anglo-allied Army was under Wellington.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Had the French army succeeded in keeping the Prussian army from joining the Anglo-allied Army under Wellington at Waterloo, Napoleon might have won the Waterloo Campaign.", "chunk_id": "d6bc7645824694ce", "doc_id": "hp_45df433ff36c6e4e", "type": "COMMANDED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_45df433ff36c6e4e</data>
