<edge source="Battle of Hansan Island" target="July 8, 1592">
  <data key="d5">["OCCURRED_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Battle of Hansan Island took place on July 8, 1592.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The naval Battle of Hansan Island, also known as the Battle of Hansando, took place on July 8, 1592, near the Korean island of Hansan.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "OCCURRED_ON"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Battle of Hansan Island" target="Korean island of Hansan">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Battle of Hansan Island took place near the Korean island of Hansan.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The naval Battle of Hansan Island, also known as the Battle of Hansando, took place on July 8, 1592, near the Korean island of Hansan.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Battle of Hansan Island" target="Admiral Yi's 3rd Naval Campaign">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Battle of Hansan Island was the first engagement in Admiral Yi's 3rd Naval Campaign.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "This battle is also the first in Admiral Yi's 3rd Naval Campaign.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Battle of Hansan Island" target="Joseon">
  <data key="d5">["WON_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Battle of Hansan Island was one of the great battles won by Joseon.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The battle, one of the three great battles won by Joseon during the Imjin Waeran, carried great import, because Joseon's forces now came to dominate the southern seas.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "WON_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Battle of Hansan Island" target="Imjin Waeran">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Battle of Hansan Island occurred during the Imjin Waeran.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The battle, one of the three great battles won by Joseon during the Imjin Waeran, carried great import, because Joseon's forces now came to dominate the southern seas.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Joseon" target="southern seas">
  <data key="d5">["DOMINATED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Joseon's forces came to dominate the southern seas after the Battle of Hansan Island.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The battle, one of the three great battles won by Joseon during the Imjin Waeran, carried great import, because Joseon's forces now came to dominate the southern seas.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "DOMINATED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Japanese navy" target="Joseon navy">
  <data key="d5">["AVOID_ENGAGEMENT_WITH"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Toyotomi Hideyoshi ordered the Japanese navy to avoid direct engagement with the Joseon navy.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "After Hansan-do Toyotomi Hideyoshi ordered the Japanese navy to avoid direct engagement with the Joseon navy and instead station itself in fortifications along the coast to defend important sea lands.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "AVOID_ENGAGEMENT_WITH"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Japanese navy" target="fortifications">
  <data key="d5">["STATIONED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Japanese navy was ordered to station itself in fortifications along the coast.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "After Hansan-do Toyotomi Hideyoshi ordered the Japanese navy to avoid direct engagement with the Joseon navy and instead station itself in fortifications along the coast to defend important sea lands.", "chunk_id": "4d06ff352195041a", "doc_id": "hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9", "type": "STATIONED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4e9436b9b6a97ad9</data>
</edge>
