  <data key="d5">["PARENT_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Gwendolen Fitzalan-Howard was the mother of Bernard Fitzalan-Howard.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "His mother was Gwendolen Fitzalan-Howard, \"suo jure\" Gwendoline Mary Herries, 12th Lady Herries of Terregles, and he inherited her peerage when she died in 1947.", "chunk_id": "004e4fd012a54ec8", "doc_id": "hp_4f583d3862c645a8", "type": "PARENT_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_4f583d3862c645a8</data>
