<edge source="milk thistle" target="Mother Mary">
  <data key="d5">["ASSOCIATED_WITH"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The milky bands on milk thistle leaves were historically said to be Mother Mary's milk.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Historically, these milky bands were said to be Mother Mary's milk, and this is the origin of another common name, St. Mary's thistle.", "chunk_id": "06967c45da7d01cb", "doc_id": "hp_4fb3a0aca6cf5736", "type": "ASSOCIATED_WITH"}]</data>
