<edge source="World War I" target="Europe">
  <data key="d5">["ORIGINATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">World War I originated in Europe.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "World War I (WWI or WW1), also known as the First World War, the Great War, or the War to End All Wars, was a global war originating in Europe that lasted from 28 July 1914 to 11 November 1918.", "chunk_id": "b344f42adf99d038", "doc_id": "hp_831bc66834df032a", "type": "ORIGINATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_831bc66834df032a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="World War I" target="trench warfare">
  <data key="d5">["CAUSED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The tactical stalemate of World War I was caused by trench warfare.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Over nine million combatants and seven million civilians died as a result of the war (including the victims of a number of genocides), a casualty rate exacerbated by the belligerents' technological and industrial sophistication, and the tactical stalemate caused by gruelling trench warfare.", "chunk_id": "b344f42adf99d038", "doc_id": "hp_831bc66834df032a", "type": "CAUSED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_831bc66834df032a</data>
</edge>
