<edge source="Chris Hegedus" target="D. A. Pennebaker">
  <data key="d5">["COLLABORATED_WITH"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Chris Hegedus and D. A. Pennebaker collaborated to edit the final version of the "Town Bloody Hall" film.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Hegedus met Pennebaker a few years later, and the two edited the final version of the film for its release in 1979.", "chunk_id": "a75812f45ba95804", "doc_id": "hp_535589d1805f024e", "type": "COLLABORATED_WITH"}]</data>
