  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Admiral Yi Sun-sin's principal base was located on Hansan Island.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The name Tongyeong means \"command post\" and is itself associated with Admiral Yi, as it refers to his principal base that was located on nearby Hansan Island.", "chunk_id": "c3d0968c45bdecd5", "doc_id": "hp_5597a745514f1f39", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
