<edge source="The Holocaust" target="Nazi Germany">
  <data key="d5">["PERPETRATED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Holocaust was perpetrated by Nazi Germany and its collaborators.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Holocaust, also referred to as the Shoah, was a genocide in which Adolf Hitler's Nazi Germany and its World War II collaborators killed some six million European Jews.", "chunk_id": "0b6495ca8fb3c7ab", "doc_id": "hp_58dc44606385cdf1", "type": "PERPETRATED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_58dc44606385cdf1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="The Holocaust" target="European Jews">
  <data key="d5">["TARGETED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Holocaust primarily targeted European Jews.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Holocaust, also referred to as the Shoah, was a genocide in which Adolf Hitler's Nazi Germany and its World War II collaborators killed some six million European Jews.", "chunk_id": "0b6495ca8fb3c7ab", "doc_id": "hp_58dc44606385cdf1", "type": "TARGETED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_58dc44606385cdf1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="The Holocaust" target="children">
  <data key="d5">["TARGETED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Children were among the victims of the Holocaust.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The victims included 1.5 million children and constituted about two-thirds of the nine million Jews in Continental Europe.", "chunk_id": "0b6495ca8fb3c7ab", "doc_id": "hp_58dc44606385cdf1", "type": "TARGETED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_58dc44606385cdf1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="The Holocaust" target="Roma">
  <data key="d5">["TARGETED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Roma were considered victims in a broader definition of the Holocaust.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "A broader definition of the Holocaust includes non-Jewish victims such as the Roma, ethnic Poles, other Slavic ethnic groups, and the disabled and mentally ill.", "chunk_id": "0b6495ca8fb3c7ab", "doc_id": "hp_58dc44606385cdf1", "type": "TARGETED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_58dc44606385cdf1</data>
</edge>
