<edge source="The Rivals for Catan" target="The Settlers of Catan">
  <data key="d5">["THEME_BASED_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The theme of The Rivals for Catan is based on the novel The Settlers of Catan.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "As with the \"Catan Adventures\" series of games, the theme is based on the Rebecca Gablé novel \"The Settlers of Catan\", a novel based on the original board game.", "chunk_id": "155359f8ca0aea2f", "doc_id": "hp_5f6bdf06a278e8d8", "type": "THEME_BASED_ON"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_5f6bdf06a278e8d8</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Catan Card Game" target="The Settlers of Catan">
  <data key="d5">["ADAPTATION_OF", "ADAPTATION_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Catan Card Game is a card game adaptation of The Settlers of Catan.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Rivals for Catan (German: \"Die Fürsten von Catan\" ) is an updated revision of the \"Catan Card Game\", a card game adaptation of \"The Settlers of Catan\".", "chunk_id": "155359f8ca0aea2f", "doc_id": "hp_5f6bdf06a278e8d8", "type": "ADAPTATION_OF"}, {"text": "The Catan Card Game, originally named The Settlers of Catan: The Card Game, is a card game adaptation of \"The Settlers of Catan\".", "chunk_id": "dbfe350afe445342", "doc_id": "hp_a2aabfc161961b2c", "type": "ADAPTATION_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_5f6bdf06a278e8d8</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Catan Card Game" target="The Settlers of Catan: The Card Game">
  <data key="d5">["HAS_ORIGINAL_NAME"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Catan Card Game was originally named The Settlers of Catan: The Card Game.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Catan Card Game, originally named The Settlers of Catan: The Card Game, is a card game adaptation of \"The Settlers of Catan\".", "chunk_id": "dbfe350afe445342", "doc_id": "hp_a2aabfc161961b2c", "type": "HAS_ORIGINAL_NAME"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_a2aabfc161961b2c</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Catan Card Game" target="Catan">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Catan Card Game is a member of the Catan series of games.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It is a member of the \"Catan\" series of games, and is published by Kosmos in German, and Mayfair Games in English.", "chunk_id": "dbfe350afe445342", "doc_id": "hp_a2aabfc161961b2c", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_a2aabfc161961b2c</data>
</edge>
