  <data key="d6">The nature conservation authorities of the Uelzen district are responsible for the Kiehnmoor reserve.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The nature conservation authorities of these districts are responsible for the reserve.", "chunk_id": "582723cb6f560140", "doc_id": "hp_5fffbcc1125c9880", "type": "RESPONSIBLE_FOR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_5fffbcc1125c9880</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Heidschnucken" target="Kiehnmoor">
  <data key="d5">["FOUND_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Heidschnucken, moorland sheep, are reared in the Kiehnmoor area.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The \"Heidschnucken\", moorland sheep characteristic of the region, are reared here.", "chunk_id": "582723cb6f560140", "doc_id": "hp_5fffbcc1125c9880", "type": "FOUND_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_5fffbcc1125c9880</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Gerdau" target="Kiehnmoor">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_NEAR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Gerdau stream valley is located north of and adjacent to the Kiehnmoor.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "North of the Kiehnmoor and immediately adjacent to it is the valley of a partially dammed stream, the \"Gerdau\", and the Brambosteler Moor nature reserve.", "chunk_id": "582723cb6f560140", "doc_id": "hp_5fffbcc1125c9880", "type": "LOCATED_NEAR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_5fffbcc1125c9880</data>
</edge>
