<edge source="Your Decision" target="November 16, 2009">
  <data key="d5">["RELEASED_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The song "Your Decision" was released as a single in the UK on November 16, 2009.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was released as the third single and fourth track from the album on November 16, 2009 in the UK, and was released in the US on December 1, 2009.", "chunk_id": "a5827a6383be59e3", "doc_id": "hp_6033a8a5e79f67f7", "type": "RELEASED_ON"}]</data>
