<edge source="Barrie Karp" target="feminism">
  <data key="d5">["HAS_PERSPECTIVE_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Barrie Karp's practice has sought to further define a rigorous mode of inquiry in feminist and anti-racist studies.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Karp's practice has largely been as an educator whose pedagogy and practice sought to further define a rigorous mode of inquiry in feminist and anti-racist studies.", "chunk_id": "866b0454e7429f00", "doc_id": "hp_65a971e7a10d79c8", "type": "HAS_PERSPECTIVE_ON"}]</data>
