<edge source="Tony Clifton" target="Andy Kaufman">
  <data key="d5">["CREATED_BY", "PORTRAYED_BY", "PERSONA_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Tony Clifton was created by Andy Kaufman.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tony Clifton is a character created by late performance artist Andy Kaufman, who also portrayed him in the late 1970s.", "chunk_id": "c6f60784815bbba5", "doc_id": "hp_89119e061210f745", "type": "CREATED_BY"}, {"text": "Tony Clifton is a character created by late performance artist Andy Kaufman, who also portrayed him in the late 1970s.", "chunk_id": "c6f60784815bbba5", "doc_id": "hp_89119e061210f745", "type": "PORTRAYED_BY"}, {"text": "In this regard, UFO Phil may be an example of Poe's law and has been compared to Andy Kaufman's persona Tony Clifton.", "chunk_id": "a57b9509e1d93532", "doc_id": "hp_bb2da19e6d96b8c5", "type": "PERSONA_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_89119e061210f745</data>
</edge>
