  <data key="d6">Matt Tong is a former member of the band Bloc Party.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Former members Matt Tong and Gordon Moakes left the band in 2013 and 2015 respectively.", "chunk_id": "71ac561d76e09011", "doc_id": "hp_69c70a8b17b9692e", "type": "FORMER_MEMBER_OF"}, {"text": "Moakes joined the band after answering an advert in \"NME\" magazine, while Tong was picked via an audition.", "chunk_id": "71ac561d76e09011", "doc_id": "hp_69c70a8b17b9692e", "type": "JOINED"}]</data>
