<edge source="Library technician" target="New technologies">
  <data key="d5">["ROLE_EXPANDED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The role of the library technician is expanding and evolving due to new technologies.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Because libraries are increasingly using new technologies (such as automated databases, CD-ROM, the Internet, and virtual libraries), the role of the library technician is expanding and evolving accordingly.", "chunk_id": "2f47939c7061409f", "doc_id": "hp_708a5f62a130daf5", "type": "ROLE_EXPANDED_BY"}]</data>
