</edge>
<edge source="Library assistant" target="Librarians">
  <data key="d5">["ASSISTS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Library assistants assist librarians in the acquisition, preparation, and organization of information.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "A library technician or library assistant is a skilled library and information professional trained to perform the day-to-day functions of a library, and assists librarians in the acquisition, preparation, and organization of information.", "chunk_id": "2f47939c7061409f", "doc_id": "hp_708a5f62a130daf5", "type": "ASSISTS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_708a5f62a130daf5</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Computerized information storage and retrieval systems" target="Technical services">
  <data key="d5">["IMPACTS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The widespread use of these systems has resulted in library technicians assisting in technical services.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The widespread use of computerized information storage and retrieval systems has resulted in library technicians assisting in the handling of technical services (such as cataloguing) that were once performed exclusively by librarians.", "chunk_id": "2f47939c7061409f", "doc_id": "hp_708a5f62a130daf5", "type": "IMPACTS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_708a5f62a130daf5</data>
</edge>
