  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The album shows the band moving into a more mainstream pop rock sound, away from their earlier funk metal and nu metal sound, due to the success of their single \"Fly\" off their prior album, \"Floored\".", "chunk_id": "a83c783458cb120f", "doc_id": "hp_767039256bd5743c", "type": "MOVED_AWAY_FROM_SOUND"}]</data>
