<edge source="Zilch memo" target="Laos">
  <data key="d5">["ABOUT"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Zilch memo was about the military situation in Laos.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "A memorandum known as the Zilch memo was an American government document sent by National Security Advisor Henry Kissinger to President Richard Nixon on January 3, 1972, about the military situation in Laos during the Vietnam War.", "chunk_id": "51c2cb97c1a1900f", "doc_id": "hp_7681eb8af0f9cd50", "type": "ABOUT"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_7681eb8af0f9cd50</data>
