<edge source="Standard Oil of Iowa" target="Iowa">
  <data key="d5">["NOT_MARKETING_AREA"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Iowa was not one of the primary marketing areas for Standard Oil of Iowa, despite its name.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Though named for the midwestern state, it never included Iowa as one of its primary marketing areas.", "chunk_id": "d3eeaf18714a1e1a", "doc_id": "hp_777b99a15f2523b1", "type": "NOT_MARKETING_AREA"}]</data>
