<edge source="Sci Fi Science: Physics of the Impossible" target="Science">
  <data key="d5">["BROADCAST_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The television series Sci Fi Science: Physics of the Impossible aired on the Science channel.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Sci Fi Science: Physics of the Impossible (also called Science of the Impossible) is an American documentary television series on Science which first aired in the United States on December 1, 2009.", "chunk_id": "fee479fd980ac770", "doc_id": "hp_78779183524b143c", "type": "BROADCAST_ON"}]</data>
