<edge source="Michio Kaku" target="technological concept from science fiction">
  <data key="d5">["ADDRESSES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">In the series, Michio Kaku addresses technological concepts from science fiction.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In each episode, Dr. Kaku addresses a technological concept from science fiction and designs his own theoretical version of the technology using currently-known science.", "chunk_id": "fee479fd980ac770", "doc_id": "hp_78779183524b143c", "type": "ADDRESSES"}]</data>
