  <data key="d6">The U.S. Army Air Service played a significant role in the Battle of Saint-Mihiel.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The U.S. Army Air Service (which later became the U.S. Air Force) played a significant role in this action.", "chunk_id": "45856128b6a22257", "doc_id": "hp_7e06d5c1c2ef0dce", "type": "PARTICIPATED_IN"}]</data>
