  <data key="d5">["WON", "ACHIEVED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Margaret Court won 21 mixed doubles titles.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Her 24 Grand Slam singles titles and 21 in mixed doubles are also all-time records for both sexes.", "chunk_id": "cc00d89bd0ab005a", "doc_id": "hp_80a1699490fb30e6", "type": "WON"}, {"text": "She achieved a career Grand Slam in singles, doubles, and mixed doubles.", "chunk_id": "cc00d89bd0ab005a", "doc_id": "hp_80a1699490fb30e6", "type": "ACHIEVED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_80a1699490fb30e6</data>
</edge>
