<edge source="Arachis monticola" target="Arachis hypogaea">
  <data key="d5">["CLOSE_RELATIVE_OF", "WILD_ANCESTOR_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Arachis monticola is a close relative of Arachis hypogaea.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Arachis monticola is a close relative of the domesticated peanut (\"Arachis hypogaea\").", "chunk_id": "4fb00b903790bf5f", "doc_id": "hp_854482b064cdae3e", "type": "CLOSE_RELATIVE_OF"}, {"text": "It is thought to be the immediate wild ancestor of peanut, although it may be a weedy form, descended from cultivated peanuts.", "chunk_id": "4fb00b903790bf5f", "doc_id": "hp_854482b064cdae3e", "type": "WILD_ANCESTOR_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_854482b064cdae3e</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Arachis monticola" target="Arachis">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Arachis monticola is a species within the genus Arachis.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Besides the peanut, it is the only other tetraploid species in the genus \"Arachis\".", "chunk_id": "4fb00b903790bf5f", "doc_id": "hp_854482b064cdae3e", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_854482b064cdae3e</data>
</edge>
