<edge source="Nick Elliott" target="Sam Saturday">
  <data key="d5">["COMMISSIONED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Nick Elliott commissioned the television series Sam Saturday.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The series was just one of a number of commissions made by LWT controller of drama Nick Elliott in 1991, following the announcement that both \"The Ruth Rendell Mysteries\" and \"Inspector Morse\" were to cease production.", "chunk_id": "991c522ae470bacd", "doc_id": "hp_8c33eb6416b6e498", "type": "COMMISSIONED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8c33eb6416b6e498</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Exit Tunes, Inc." target="Quake Records">
  <data key="d5">["RENAMED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Exit Tunes, Inc. was previously known as Quake Records.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The company was founded as a printing company in 2001, however later became a music company known as Quake Records in 2003.", "chunk_id": "590e8bd6ca347d80", "doc_id": "hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2", "type": "RENAMED_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Exit Tunes, Inc." target="Pony Canyon">
  <data key="d5">["SUBSIDIARY_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Exit Tunes, Inc. became a subsidiary of Pony Canyon.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The company became a subsidiary of Pony Canyon in 2009 (later becoming a wholly owned subsidiary in 2014), and was renamed Exit Tunes in 2011.", "chunk_id": "590e8bd6ca347d80", "doc_id": "hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2", "type": "SUBSIDIARY_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Quake Records" target="Quake Holdings">
  <data key="d5">["RENAMED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Quake Records was renamed to Quake Holdings.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In 2005, the company was renamed to Quake Holdings.", "chunk_id": "590e8bd6ca347d80", "doc_id": "hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2", "type": "RENAMED_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Quake Holdings" target="Exit Tunes, Inc.">
  <data key="d5">["RENAMED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Quake Holdings was renamed to Exit Tunes, Inc.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The company became a subsidiary of Pony Canyon in 2009 (later becoming a wholly owned subsidiary in 2014), and was renamed Exit Tunes in 2011.", "chunk_id": "590e8bd6ca347d80", "doc_id": "hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2", "type": "RENAMED_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8c3eb2c860de1dc2</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Casuarina Tree" target="creeper">
  <data key="d5">["BEARS", "COVERED_WITH"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Casuarina Tree is strong enough to bear the tight hold of the creeper.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The tree is so strong that it bears the tight hold of the creeper.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "BEARS"}, {"text": "The Casuarina Tree is covered with creeper which bears red crimson flowers which appear as though the tree is wearing a colorful scarf.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "COVERED_WITH"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cb6340f34038734</data>
</edge>
<edge source="creeper" target="Casuarina Tree">
  <data key="d5">["WOUND_AROUND"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The creeper has wound itself around the trunk of the Casuarina Tree.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The poet says that the creeper has wound itself round the rugged trunk of the Casuarina Tree, like a huge Python.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "WOUND_AROUND"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cb6340f34038734</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Toru Dutt" target="Casuarina Tree">
  <data key="d5">["FEELS_DEAR_TO", "IMMORTALIZES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Casuarina Tree is dear to Toru Dutt's heart and soul, not just for its appearance but also for the happy moments spent under it with siblings.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Toru Dutt says that it is not because of the majestic appearance of the Casuarina Tree that it is dear to her heart and soul, but also that she along with her siblings spent happy moments under it.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "FEELS_DEAR_TO"}, {"text": "She immortalizes the tree through this poem like how Wordsworth sanctified the Yew trees of Borrowdale.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "IMMORTALIZES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cb6340f34038734</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Toru Dutt" target="France">
  <data key="d5">["STUDIED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Toru Dutt studied in France.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Even in France and Italy (where the poet studied), she can hear the tree's lament.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "STUDIED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cb6340f34038734</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Toru Dutt" target="Italy">
  <data key="d5">["STUDIED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Toru Dutt studied in Italy.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Even in France and Italy (where the poet studied), she can hear the tree's lament.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "STUDIED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cb6340f34038734</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Toru Dutt" target="Oblivion">
  <data key="d5">["DEFENDS_FROM"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Toru Dutt's love for the Casuarina Tree is intended to defend it from the curse of Oblivion.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "She says \"May love defend thee from Oblivion's curse'\"- by which she means that she is glad that her love for the Casuarina will protect it from the curse of being forgotten.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "DEFENDS_FROM"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cb6340f34038734</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Wordsworth" target="Yew trees of Borrowdale">
  <data key="d5">["SANCTIFIED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Wordsworth sanctified the Yew trees of Borrowdale.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "She immortalizes the tree through this poem like how Wordsworth sanctified the Yew trees of Borrowdale.", "chunk_id": "4311709e1a9f0b6d", "doc_id": "hp_8cb6340f34038734", "type": "SANCTIFIED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cb6340f34038734</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Robert Keith Orton Jr." target="Bob Orton Sr.">
  <data key="d5">["SON_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Robert Keith Orton Jr. is the son of professional wrestler Bob Orton Sr.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "He is the son of professional wrestler Bob Orton Sr., the brother of professional wrestler Barry Orton, and the father of professional wrestler Randy Orton.", "chunk_id": "107bd8714a8dad71", "doc_id": "hp_8cbd595289b581da", "type": "SON_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cbd595289b581da</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Robert Keith Orton Jr." target="Barry Orton">
  <data key="d5">["BROTHER_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Robert Keith Orton Jr. is the brother of professional wrestler Barry Orton.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "He is the son of professional wrestler Bob Orton Sr., the brother of professional wrestler Barry Orton, and the father of professional wrestler Randy Orton.", "chunk_id": "107bd8714a8dad71", "doc_id": "hp_8cbd595289b581da", "type": "BROTHER_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8cbd595289b581da</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Robert Keith Orton Jr." target="Randy Orton">
  <data key="d5">["FATHER_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Robert Keith Orton Jr. is the father of professional wrestler Randy Orton.</data>
