<edge source="Stand Up Speak Up" target="January 2005">
  <data key="d5">["INTRODUCED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Stand Up Speak Up campaign was launched in January 2005.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Stand Up Speak Up was a Europe-wide campaign that was launched in January 2005 by the French Football player Thierry Henry following an increase in reports of racist incidents in football across Europe.", "chunk_id": "5ffaca7aaea4985f", "doc_id": "hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1", "type": "INTRODUCED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Stand Up Speak Up" target="Thierry Henry">
  <data key="d5">["FOUNDED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Stand Up Speak Up campaign was launched by Thierry Henry.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Stand Up Speak Up was a Europe-wide campaign that was launched in January 2005 by the French Football player Thierry Henry following an increase in reports of racist incidents in football across Europe.", "chunk_id": "5ffaca7aaea4985f", "doc_id": "hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1", "type": "FOUNDED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Stand Up Speak Up" target="racism">
  <data key="d5">["USED_FOR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Stand Up Speak Up campaign was used to protest against racism.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Together with Nike and other top European players, he protests against this continuing problem inviting football fans to voice their opposition to racism.", "chunk_id": "5ffaca7aaea4985f", "doc_id": "hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1", "type": "USED_FOR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Thierry Henry" target="Nike">
  <data key="d5">["PARTNERED_WITH"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Thierry Henry partnered with Nike for the Stand Up Speak Up campaign.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Together with Nike and other top European players, he protests against this continuing problem inviting football fans to voice their opposition to racism.", "chunk_id": "5ffaca7aaea4985f", "doc_id": "hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1", "type": "PARTNERED_WITH"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8e54e49df0cdefb1</data>
</edge>
