<edge source="Stanford Research Park" target="Silicon Valley">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Stanford Research Park played a key role in the creation of Silicon Valley.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Frederick Terman is often credited with the idea and success of the Stanford Research Park, which was the first university-owned industrial park at the time of its founding and played a key role in creation of Silicon Valley.", "chunk_id": "8d1ae06c7ff4736d", "doc_id": "hp_8e65f4aec073c221", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8e65f4aec073c221</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Stanford Industrial Park" target="Stanford Research Park">
  <data key="d5">["PREVIOUS_NAME_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Stanford Industrial Park was the original name of Stanford Research Park.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Built in 1951, as Stanford Industrial Park, it claims to be the world's first technology-focused office park.", "chunk_id": "8d1ae06c7ff4736d", "doc_id": "hp_8e65f4aec073c221", "type": "PREVIOUS_NAME_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8e65f4aec073c221</data>
</edge>
