<edge source="Tom Crouch" target="Huffman Prairie">
  <data key="d5">["COMMENTED_ON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Tom Crouch commented on the events taking place in the sky over Torrence Huffman's pasture (Huffman Prairie).</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"As their flights grew ever longer in September and October 1905, local citizens and area journalists finally realized that something extraordinary was taking place in the sky over Torrence Huffman’s pasture,\" notes aviation historian Tom Crouch.", "chunk_id": "909c6d3ef553b8b9", "doc_id": "hp_8fc220871dced370", "type": "COMMENTED_ON"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_8fc220871dced370</data>
</edge>
