  <data key="d6">Dean Jones made a cameo appearance in the 1997 remake of That Darn Cat!.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The 1997 remake includes a cameo appearance by Dean Jones.", "chunk_id": "15791e4c51cf1c4f", "doc_id": "hp_91f76bb6a0249df4", "type": "APPEARED_IN_REMAKE"}, {"text": "Dean Carroll Jones (January 25, 1931 – September 1, 2015) was an American actor best known for his roles as Agent Zeke Kelso in \"That Darn Cat!\" (1965), Jim Douglas in \"The Love Bug\" (1968), Albert Dooley in \"The Million Dollar Duck\" (1971; for which he received a Golden Globe nomination) and Dr. Herman Varnick in \"Beethoven\" (1992).", "chunk_id": "4e0b5afeba15a2e6", "doc_id": "hp_f030450c7e2b1450", "type": "ACTED_IN"}]</data>
