  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The order includes just three families of flowering plants, the Austrobaileyaceae, a monotypic family containing the sole genus, \"Austrobaileya scandens\", a woody liana, the Schisandraceae, a family of trees, shrubs, or lianas containing essential oils, and the Trimeniaceae, essential oil-bearing trees and lianas.", "chunk_id": "acac422bb08fd6af", "doc_id": "hp_a1b81ed862b4cf7f", "type": "CONTAINS"}]</data>
