<edge source="Bokuzen Hidari" target="Ikiru">
  <data key="d5">["APPEARED_IN", "FAMOUS_FOR_SCENES_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Bokuzen Hidari appeared in the film "Ikiru".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "He appeared in such films as Akira Kurosawa's \"Seven Samurai\", \"The Lower Depths\" and \"Ikiru\".", "chunk_id": "bd018a45665dcb2e", "doc_id": "hp_a6decab6ae6a1912", "type": "APPEARED_IN"}, {"text": "Hidari was famous among Japanese audiences for his portrayals of meek, downtrodden men, and although a teetotaller, was renowned for his convincing drunk scenes (see esp. \"Ikiru\").", "chunk_id": "bd018a45665dcb2e", "doc_id": "hp_a6decab6ae6a1912", "type": "FAMOUS_FOR_SCENES_IN"}]</data>
