  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Yandang Mountains cover much of the prefecture-level city of Wenzhou.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Yandang Mountains or Yandangshan (Chinese:  雁蕩山 ,  雁荡山 ,  \"Yàndàng Shān\",  \"Wild Goose Pond Mountain(s)\") refers, in the broad sense, to a coastal mountain range in southeastern Zhejiang province in eastern China, covering much of the prefecture-level city of Wenzhou (from Pingyang County in the south to Yueqing County in the northeast) and extending to the county-level city of Wenling in Taizhou prefecture.", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
