  <data key="d5">["DISTINGUISHED_FROM"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The article distinguishes between the Yandang Mountains (the range) and Mt. Yandang (the caldera).</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In this article, name \"Yandang Mountains\" is used to refer the mountain range and \"Mt. Yandang\" to refer to the caldera.", "chunk_id": "696929108fab1bcf", "doc_id": "hp_a71b119b261e3b26", "type": "DISTINGUISHED_FROM"}]</data>
