<edge source="Pachypodium" target="pachus">
  <data key="d5">["DERIVES_FROM"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The name "Pachypodium" comes from the Greek word "pachus" meaning 'thick'.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"Pachypodium\" comes from a Latin form from Greek \"pachus\" (thick) and \"podion\" (foot) (or Gk podos, root form of pous, foot), hence meaning \"thick-footed\".", "chunk_id": "c65de02bc9af4260", "doc_id": "hp_a9669326c71f5122", "type": "DERIVES_FROM"}]</data>
