<edge source="G59 – 1st Swiss Horticulture Exhibition" target="Swiss horticulture exhibitions">
  <data key="d5">["IS_A"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The G59 exhibition is an instance of Swiss horticulture exhibitions.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The G59 – 1st Swiss Horticulture Exhibition was the first of two Swiss horticulture exhibitions up until now.", "chunk_id": "a9b5754861a849a2", "doc_id": "hp_a9d3423ff7479e28", "type": "IS_A"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_a9d3423ff7479e28</data>
</edge>
<edge source="G59 – 1st Swiss Horticulture Exhibition" target="Zurich">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The G59 exhibition took place in Zurich.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It took place from April 25 to October 11, 1959 in Zurich and covered an area of about 37 acres on the right and left banks of lower Lake Zurich.", "chunk_id": "a9b5754861a849a2", "doc_id": "hp_a9d3423ff7479e28", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_a9d3423ff7479e28</data>
</edge>
<edge source="G59 – 1st Swiss Horticulture Exhibition" target="Lake Zurich">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The G59 exhibition covered areas on the banks of Lake Zurich.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It took place from April 25 to October 11, 1959 in Zurich and covered an area of about 37 acres on the right and left banks of lower Lake Zurich.", "chunk_id": "a9b5754861a849a2", "doc_id": "hp_a9d3423ff7479e28", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_a9d3423ff7479e28</data>
</edge>
<edge source="G59 – 1st Swiss Horticulture Exhibition" target="commuter ferries">
  <data key="d5">["USED_FOR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Commuter ferries were used to connect parts of the G59 exhibition.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The two separate halves of the exposition were connected by commuter ferries and a specially created cable car.", "chunk_id": "a9b5754861a849a2", "doc_id": "hp_a9d3423ff7479e28", "type": "USED_FOR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_a9d3423ff7479e28</data>
</edge>
