<edge source="Byron K. Lichtenberg" target="NASA">
  <data key="d5">["WORKS_AT"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Byron K. Lichtenberg flew aboard two NASA Space Shuttle missions as a Payload Specialist.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Byron Kurt Lichtenberg, Sc. D. (born February 19, 1948) is an American engineer and fighter pilot who flew aboard two NASA Space Shuttle missions as a Payload Specialist.", "chunk_id": "986fec5d5c4ec7fd", "doc_id": "hp_ab0e95c94eff4211", "type": "WORKS_AT"}]</data>
