  <data key="d6">Sino-Tibetan languages are also known as Tibeto-Burman in some sources.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Sino-Tibetan languages, in a few sources also known as Tibeto-Burman or Trans-Himalayan, are a family of more than 400 languages spoken in East Asia, Southeast Asia and South Asia.", "chunk_id": "8d2f0f99801ebf15", "doc_id": "hp_b4175e524ae4a823", "type": "OTHER"}]</data>
