  <data key="d5">["CREATED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Kip S. Thorne was one of the creators of the black hole membrane paradigm approach.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "This approach to the theory of black holes was created by Kip S. Thorne, R. H. Price and D. A. Macdonald.", "chunk_id": "fa3f5736c05b811f", "doc_id": "hp_b71363459a2e11a3", "type": "CREATED_BY"}]</data>
