<edge source="Falange Española de las JONS" target="Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista">
  <data key="d5">["MERGED_INTO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Falange Española de las JONS was merged into Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Falange Española de las JONS ceased to exist as such when, during the Spanish Civil War, General Francisco Franco merged it with the Traditionalists in April 1937 to form the similarly named Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista, which became the sole legal party in Spain until its dissolution in 1977.", "chunk_id": "da2cebd3507fe424", "doc_id": "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0", "type": "MERGED_INTO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7901eef5f6745f0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Falange Española de las JONS" target="Spanish Civil War">
  <data key="d5">["OCCURRED_DURING"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The cessation of Falange Española de las JONS occurred during the Spanish Civil War.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Falange Española de las JONS ceased to exist as such when, during the Spanish Civil War, General Francisco Franco merged it with the Traditionalists in April 1937 to form the similarly named Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista, which became the sole legal party in Spain until its dissolution in 1977.", "chunk_id": "da2cebd3507fe424", "doc_id": "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0", "type": "OCCURRED_DURING"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7901eef5f6745f0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Falange Española" target="Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional-Sindicalista">
  <data key="d5">["MERGER"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Falange Española and Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional-Sindicalista merged to form Falange Española de las JONS.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Falange Española de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional-Sindicalista (Spanish for \"Spanish Phalanx of the Councils of the National-Syndicalist Offensive\"; \"FE de las JONS\" for short), or simply called the \"Falange\" (  ), was a Fascist and National Syndicalist political party founded in 1934 in Spain as merger of the Falange Española (founded in October 1933) and the Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional-Sindicalista (founded in October 1931).", "chunk_id": "da2cebd3507fe424", "doc_id": "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0", "type": "MERGER"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7901eef5f6745f0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="General Francisco Franco" target="Falange Española de las JONS">
  <data key="d5">["MERGED_WITH"]</data>
  <data key="d6">General Francisco Franco merged Falange Española de las JONS with the Traditionalists.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Falange Española de las JONS ceased to exist as such when, during the Spanish Civil War, General Francisco Franco merged it with the Traditionalists in April 1937 to form the similarly named Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista, which became the sole legal party in Spain until its dissolution in 1977.", "chunk_id": "da2cebd3507fe424", "doc_id": "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0", "type": "MERGED_WITH"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7901eef5f6745f0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista" target="Spain">
  <data key="d5">["LEGAL_PARTY_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista became the sole legal party in Spain.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Falange Española de las JONS ceased to exist as such when, during the Spanish Civil War, General Francisco Franco merged it with the Traditionalists in April 1937 to form the similarly named Falange Española Tradicionalista y de las Juntas de Ofensiva Nacional Sindicalista, which became the sole legal party in Spain until its dissolution in 1977.", "chunk_id": "da2cebd3507fe424", "doc_id": "hp_b7901eef5f6745f0", "type": "LEGAL_PARTY_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7901eef5f6745f0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tikkun HaKlali" target="teshuvah">
  <data key="d5">["USED_FOR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The recital of Tikkun HaKlali serves as teshuvah (repentance).</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tikkun HaKlali (Hebrew: תיקון הכללי‎ ‎ , lit., \"The General (or Comprehensive) Rectification\"), also known as The General Remedy, is a set of ten Psalms whose recital serves as \"teshuvah\" (repentance) for all sins — in particular the sin of wasted seed through involuntary nocturnal emission or masturbation.", "chunk_id": "45f2af9ee3147719", "doc_id": "hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a", "type": "USED_FOR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tikkun HaKlali" target="The General Remedy">
  <data key="d5">["SYNONYM"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The General Remedy is another name for Tikkun HaKlali.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tikkun HaKlali (Hebrew: תיקון הכללי‎ ‎ , lit., \"The General (or Comprehensive) Rectification\"), also known as The General Remedy, is a set of ten Psalms whose recital serves as \"teshuvah\" (repentance) for all sins — in particular the sin of wasted seed through involuntary nocturnal emission or masturbation.", "chunk_id": "45f2af9ee3147719", "doc_id": "hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a", "type": "SYNONYM"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Rebbe Nachman of Breslov" target="Tikkun HaKlali">
  <data key="d5">["INNOVATED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Rebbe Nachman of Breslov is the originator of the Tikkun HaKlali.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The \"Tikkun HaKlali\" is a unique innovation of Rebbe Nachman of Breslov, and its recital is a regular practice of Breslover Hasidim to this day.", "chunk_id": "45f2af9ee3147719", "doc_id": "hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a", "type": "INNOVATED"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Breslover Hasidim" target="Tikkun HaKlali">
  <data key="d5">["PRACTICES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Breslover Hasidim regularly practice the recital of the Tikkun HaKlali.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The \"Tikkun HaKlali\" is a unique innovation of Rebbe Nachman of Breslov, and its recital is a regular practice of Breslover Hasidim to this day.", "chunk_id": "45f2af9ee3147719", "doc_id": "hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a", "type": "PRACTICES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b7e7ca08cd26001a</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Cinema of Korea" target="North Korea">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Cinema of Korea includes the motion picture industry of North Korea.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The term \"Cinema of Korea\" (or \"Korean cinema\") encompasses the motion picture industries of North and South Korea.", "chunk_id": "ab78baf12b2f8b16", "doc_id": "hp_b840ad7146ba28d6", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b840ad7146ba28d6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Cinema of Korea" target="South Korea">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Cinema of Korea includes the motion picture industry of South Korea.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The term \"Cinema of Korea\" (or \"Korean cinema\") encompasses the motion picture industries of North and South Korea.", "chunk_id": "ab78baf12b2f8b16", "doc_id": "hp_b840ad7146ba28d6", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b840ad7146ba28d6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Cinema of Korea" target="Joseon Dynasty">
  <data key="d5">["AFFECTED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Cinema of Korea was affected by political events during the late Joseon dynasty.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "As with all aspects of Korean life during the past century, the film industry has often been at the mercy of political events, from the late Joseon dynasty to the Korean War to domestic governmental interference.", "chunk_id": "ab78baf12b2f8b16", "doc_id": "hp_b840ad7146ba28d6", "type": "AFFECTED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b840ad7146ba28d6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Cinema of Korea" target="Korean War">
  <data key="d5">["AFFECTED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Cinema of Korea was affected by political events during the Korean War.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "As with all aspects of Korean life during the past century, the film industry has often been at the mercy of political events, from the late Joseon dynasty to the Korean War to domestic governmental interference.", "chunk_id": "ab78baf12b2f8b16", "doc_id": "hp_b840ad7146ba28d6", "type": "AFFECTED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b840ad7146ba28d6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="North Korea" target="Cinema of Korea">
  <data key="d5">["HAS_INDUSTRY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">North Korea has a relatively robust film industry that tends to portray communist or revolutionary themes.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "While both countries have relatively robust film industries today, only South Korean films have achieved wide international acclaim.", "chunk_id": "ab78baf12b2f8b16", "doc_id": "hp_b840ad7146ba28d6", "type": "HAS_INDUSTRY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b840ad7146ba28d6</data>
</edge>
<edge source="North Korea" target="North Korean cinema">
  <data key="d5">["OTHER"]</data>
  <data key="d6">North Korea is the country associated with North Korean cinema.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Because of the isolated nature of the country, information—particularly unbiased information—on North Korean cinema is difficult to find.", "chunk_id": "7cd59a2829630305", "doc_id": "hp_bb98f886833576c8", "type": "OTHER"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_bb98f886833576c8</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Russian Route A180" target="Saint Petersburg">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Russian Route A180 runs from Saint Petersburg.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Russian Route A180, also known as Narva Highway (Russian: Федера́льная автомоби́льная доро́га А180 «На́рва» , Federal highway A180 \"Narva\") is a Russian federal highway that runs from Saint Petersburg through Ivangorod up to the border with Estonia by the Narva River, with the Estonian city of Narva on the opposite bank, which explains the name of the highway.", "chunk_id": "53eccf7b7bf86b26", "doc_id": "hp_b85dbf7e5499fa3f", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_b85dbf7e5499fa3f</data>
</edge>
