<edge source="Castor and Pollux" target="RRS Discovery II">
  <data key="d5">["NAMED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The name "Castor and Pollux" was given during a survey by RRS Discovery II.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "This rock, with its neighbor Castor Rock, was named \"Castor and Pollux\" during the survey of these islands from \"RRS Discovery II\" in 1930.", "chunk_id": "5492b7c1b1697966", "doc_id": "hp_bd3863e9ad3c06bc", "type": "NAMED_BY"}]</data>
