  <data key="d5">["OBJECTIVE_RELEASE"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The US 187 RCT aimed to release American and South Korean prisoners of war.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "On 20 October US 187 RCT had parachuted ahead of the advancing UN spearheads into drop zones in Sukchon and Sunchon, 40 km north of the capital Pyongyang, with the objectives of cutting off the retreating North Korean forces that were withdrawing up the west coast of the Korean Peninsula and releasing American and South Korean prisoners of war.", "chunk_id": "3b98f4b424fb0646", "doc_id": "hp_c1f8f58c74899fbc", "type": "OBJECTIVE_RELEASE"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_c1f8f58c74899fbc</data>
</edge>
<edge source="US 187 RCT" target="North Korean 239th Regiment">
  <data key="d5">["CAME_UNDER_ATTACK_FROM"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The US 187 RCT came under heavy attack from the North Korean 239th Regiment.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "However, on 21 October as US 187 RCT began to advance south to the clear the Sukchon to Yongju road towards Pyongyang the Americans came under heavy attack from the North Korean 239th Regiment, and requested assistance.", "chunk_id": "3b98f4b424fb0646", "doc_id": "hp_c1f8f58c74899fbc", "type": "CAME_UNDER_ATTACK_FROM"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_c1f8f58c74899fbc</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Ceanothus leucodermis" target="Rhamnaceae">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ceanothus leucodermis is a species of shrub in the buckthorn family Rhamnaceae.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ceanothus leucodermis, with the common name chaparral whitethorn or chaparral white thorn, is a species of shrub in the buckthorn family Rhamnaceae.", "chunk_id": "c9bcac595ad54970", "doc_id": "hp_c2054f4e8704c0e5", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
