</edge>
<edge source="Ceanothus leucodermis" target="mule deer">
  <data key="d5">["CONSUMED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ceanothus leucodermis is an importance browse for mule deer.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "This \"Ceanothus\" is an importance browse for several types of ungulate, such as the mule deer and bighorn sheep, who prefer the new growth and shoots to the older, spiny parts.", "chunk_id": "c9bcac595ad54970", "doc_id": "hp_c2054f4e8704c0e5", "type": "CONSUMED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_c2054f4e8704c0e5</data>
