<edge source="Superior Bancorp" target="Regions Financial Corporation">
  <data key="d5">["RANKED_BELOW"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Superior Bancorp was the second-largest community bank holding company in Alabama, behind Regions Financial Corporation.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Before its demise, the company stood as the second-largest community bank holding company in Alabama, behind Regions Financial Corporation, and third largest when including foreign-based, but locally headquartered, BBVA Compass.", "chunk_id": "6085be5766826ce9", "doc_id": "hp_c26329b4dd98f983", "type": "RANKED_BELOW"}]</data>
