<edge source="Dark Horse Comics" target="Those Left Behind">
  <data key="d5">["PUBLISHED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Dark Horse Comics published the first issue of the "Serenity" comic "Those Left Behind".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"Those Left Behind\" was popular: the first issue was the highest-selling comic published by Dark Horse Comics since the release of \"Buffy Season 8\" in 2007, while the trade paperback is still one of the highest ranking items by sale quantity from that company.", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4", "type": "PUBLISHED"}]</data>
