  <data key="d6">"Better Days" is a second miniseries within the "Serenity" comic universe.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In early 2008, a second miniseries was released. Titled \"Better Days\", it was set before \"Those Left Behind\", with the storyline based around a heist that went in the characters' favor.", "chunk_id": "cd990647fd5220d8", "doc_id": "hp_c4877bdc7a93f3f4", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
