<edge source="Iwan Knorr" target="Hoch Conservatory">
  <data key="d5">["WORKED_AT"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Iwan Knorr joined the faculty of the Hoch Conservatory and later became its director.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In 1883 he settled in Frankfurt, where he joined the faculty of the Hoch Conservatory; in 1908 he became director of the school.", "chunk_id": "902ae288e12f1dfb", "doc_id": "hp_d0d1ade1227af443", "type": "WORKED_AT"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_d0d1ade1227af443</data>
</edge>
