  <data key="d6">The 41st Battalion, Royal New South Wales Regiment has a depot in Coffs Harbour.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It is based in northern New South Wales, with its headquarters in Lismore and depots in a number of locations including Tweed Heads, Taree, Grafton, Kempsey, Port Macquarie and Coffs Harbour.", "chunk_id": "18cfadbc25fe419e", "doc_id": "hp_cf67bd08ea76563b", "type": "HAS_DEPOT_IN"}]</data>
