<edge source="41st Battalion, Royal New South Wales Regiment" target="Scottish Rifles unit">
  <data key="d5">["LINEAGE_BACK_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The 41st Battalion, Royal New South Wales Regiment can trace its lineage back to a Scottish Rifles unit.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In its present form the battalion was raised in 1965, however, it can trace its lineage back to a Scottish Rifles unit formed in 1899.", "chunk_id": "18cfadbc25fe419e", "doc_id": "hp_cf67bd08ea76563b", "type": "LINEAGE_BACK_TO"}]</data>
