  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Pizza of Death Records was created as a record label inside Fat Wreck Chords.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was created in 1994 as a record label inside a record label (Fat Wreck Chords), and officially established itself as fully independent in 1999 with the release of Hi-Standard's \"Making the Road\".", "chunk_id": "7fcbe97a0e441ab4", "doc_id": "hp_d534800743a3d491", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
