  <data key="d5">["COVERED"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Reba McEntire's version of "You Keep Me Hangin' On" reached number 2 on the US "Billboard" Hot Dance Club Play chart in 1996.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "In 1996, country music singer Reba McEntire's version reached number 2 on the US \"Billboard\" Hot Dance Club Play chart.", "chunk_id": "b4d3f874cde3d202", "doc_id": "hp_d679581e3707876c", "type": "COVERED"}]</data>
