  <data key="d6">The concept of cyberspace was popularized in William Gibson's novel "Neuromancer".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Gibson notably coined the term \"cyberspace\" in his short story \"Burning Chrome\" (1982) and later popularized the concept in his acclaimed debut novel \"Neuromancer\" (1984).", "chunk_id": "4bb65110bd5235e2", "doc_id": "hp_daedfde9b7ca2260", "type": "POPULARIZED_CONCEPT"}]</data>
