<edge source="Ian Joyce" target="Colorado Rapids">
  <data key="d5">["PLAYED_FOR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Ian Joyce most recently played for the Colorado Rapids.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Ian Francis Joyce (born July 12, 1985) is an American soccer player who most recently played for Major League Soccer club Colorado Rapids.", "chunk_id": "43aad4e477f8ff50", "doc_id": "hp_daef9730974fe681", "type": "PLAYED_FOR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_daef9730974fe681</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tedisamil" target="atrial fibrillation">
  <data key="d5">["TREATS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Tedisamil is being investigated for the treatment of atrial fibrillation.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tedisamil (3,7-dicyclopropylmethyl-9,9-tetramethylene-3,7-diazabicyclo-3,3,1-nonane) is an experimental class III antiarrhythmic agent currently being investigated for the treatment of atrial fibrillation.", "chunk_id": "b7d2a8a0d65a6290", "doc_id": "hp_db684e0053d7062f", "type": "TREATS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_db684e0053d7062f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tedisamil" target="potassium channels">
  <data key="d5">["BLOCKS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Tedisamil blocks multiple types of potassium channels.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tedisamil blocks multiple types of potassium channels in the heart resulting in slowed heart rate.", "chunk_id": "b7d2a8a0d65a6290", "doc_id": "hp_db684e0053d7062f", "type": "BLOCKS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_db684e0053d7062f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tedisamil" target="Class III antiarrhythmic agent">
  <data key="d5">["IS_A"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Tedisamil is an experimental class III antiarrhythmic agent.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tedisamil (3,7-dicyclopropylmethyl-9,9-tetramethylene-3,7-diazabicyclo-3,3,1-nonane) is an experimental class III antiarrhythmic agent currently being investigated for the treatment of atrial fibrillation.", "chunk_id": "b7d2a8a0d65a6290", "doc_id": "hp_db684e0053d7062f", "type": "IS_A"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_db684e0053d7062f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tedisamil" target="atria">
  <data key="d5">["AFFECTS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The effects of tedisamil have been demonstrated in atrial muscle.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "While the effects of tedisamil have been demonstrated in both atrial and ventricular muscle, repolarization is prolonged more efficiently in the atria.", "chunk_id": "b7d2a8a0d65a6290", "doc_id": "hp_db684e0053d7062f", "type": "AFFECTS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_db684e0053d7062f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tedisamil" target="ventricular muscle">
  <data key="d5">["AFFECTS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The effects of tedisamil have been demonstrated in ventricular muscle.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "While the effects of tedisamil have been demonstrated in both atrial and ventricular muscle, repolarization is prolonged more efficiently in the atria.", "chunk_id": "b7d2a8a0d65a6290", "doc_id": "hp_db684e0053d7062f", "type": "AFFECTS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_db684e0053d7062f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tedisamil" target="angina">
  <data key="d5">["INVESTIGATED_FOR"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Tedisamil was initially investigated as a potential treatment for angina.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tedisamil also has significant anti-ischemic properties and was initially investigated as a potential treatment for angina until its antiarrhythmic effects were discovered.", "chunk_id": "b7d2a8a0d65a6290", "doc_id": "hp_db684e0053d7062f", "type": "INVESTIGATED_FOR"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_db684e0053d7062f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="potassium channels" target="heart">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Potassium channels are located in the heart.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Tedisamil blocks multiple types of potassium channels in the heart resulting in slowed heart rate.", "chunk_id": "b7d2a8a0d65a6290", "doc_id": "hp_db684e0053d7062f", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_db684e0053d7062f</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Notre Dame High School for Girls" target="St. Ferdinand Parish">
  <data key="d5">["PART_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Notre Dame High School for Girls became part of the St. Ferdinand Parish after being incorporated by the Archdiocese of Chicago.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Notre Dame High School for Girls was founded in 1938 by the Sisters of Notre Dame de Namur and in 2009, was incorporated by the Archdiocese of Chicago, making it part of the St. Ferdinand Parish.", "chunk_id": "e1f93f4fdb5e61f5", "doc_id": "hp_db88fb2791fae586", "type": "PART_OF"}]</data>
