<edge source="P. J. Skellerup" target="Canterbury Museum">
  <data key="d5">["SPONSORED", "DONATED_TO", "DONATED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">P. J. Skellerup sponsored the Antarctic wing at Canterbury Museum.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Named in honor of P. J. Skellerup, who sponsored the Antarctic wing at Canterbury Museum.", "chunk_id": "24745fbcaed93050", "doc_id": "hp_ddd63b870a280fcc", "type": "SPONSORED"}, {"text": "He is particularly keen on scientific research and donated money to build a specialist Antarctic Library at the Museum.", "chunk_id": "24745fbcaed93050", "doc_id": "hp_ddd63b870a280fcc", "type": "DONATED_TO"}, {"text": "He also donated a large collection of Antarctic materials to the Museum, including some very old and rare Antarctic manuscripts.", "chunk_id": "24745fbcaed93050", "doc_id": "hp_ddd63b870a280fcc", "type": "DONATED_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_ddd63b870a280fcc</data>
</edge>
