<edge source="Switched at Birth" target="ABC Family">
  <data key="d5">["BROADCAST_BY", "RENEWED_BY", "RENEWED_BY", "RENEWED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">"Switched at Birth" premiered on ABC Family.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "\"Switched at Birth\" is an American television drama series which premiered on ABC Family on June 6, 2011.", "chunk_id": "68f2669524935a0c", "doc_id": "hp_e1ac370e046d40b5", "type": "BROADCAST_BY"}, {"text": "On August 17, 2012, ABC Family renewed \"Switched at Birth\" for a second season, which premiered on January 7, 2013.", "chunk_id": "68f2669524935a0c", "doc_id": "hp_e1ac370e046d40b5", "type": "RENEWED_BY"}, {"text": "On July 30, 2013, ABC Family renewed the series for a full 22-episode third season, which premiered in January 2014.", "chunk_id": "68f2669524935a0c", "doc_id": "hp_e1ac370e046d40b5", "type": "RENEWED_BY"}, {"text": "On August 13, 2014, the series was renewed for a fourth season, which premiered on January 6, 2015.", "chunk_id": "68f2669524935a0c", "doc_id": "hp_e1ac370e046d40b5", "type": "RENEWED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e1ac370e046d40b5</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Switched at Birth" target="Lizzy Weiss">
  <data key="d5">["CREATED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Lizzy Weiss created the series "Switched at Birth".</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Created by Lizzy Weiss, the series follows two teenage girls who learn that they were switched at birth.", "chunk_id": "68f2669524935a0c", "doc_id": "hp_e1ac370e046d40b5", "type": "CREATED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e1ac370e046d40b5</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Switched at Birth" target="Freeform">
  <data key="d5">["RENEWED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Freeform (formerly ABC Family) renewed the series "Switched at Birth" for a fifth and final season.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "ABC Family, which changed its name to Freeform in January 2016, announced on Wednesday October 21, 2015, that it had renewed the series for a fifth and final season.", "chunk_id": "68f2669524935a0c", "doc_id": "hp_e1ac370e046d40b5", "type": "RENEWED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e1ac370e046d40b5</data>
</edge>
