  <data key="d6">The magazine "Western Dime Novels" used the term "dime novel" as its title.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The term was used as a title as late as 1940, in the short-lived pulp magazine \"Western Dime Novels\".", "chunk_id": "0f2d5a5e9d103a1e", "doc_id": "hp_e364a8973c287ebf", "type": "IS_A"}]</data>
