  <data key="d6">Lord Edmund FitzAlan-Howard resumed the surnames of FitzAlan-Howard.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Shortly after being raised to the peerage he resumed the surnames of FitzAlan-Howard in lieu of Talbot.", "chunk_id": "5339cb4abc2a7e68", "doc_id": "hp_e45eb2b0da78e861", "type": "RESUMED_SURNAME"}]</data>
