  <data key="d6">The Hunter EP was released by Wichita Recordings in the UK.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It was released on 7 November 2011 by Wichita Recordings in the UK, set back a week from the original release date, and 3 days earlier on 4 November 2011 by Wichita Recordings and Liberator Music in Australia.", "chunk_id": "145e5d0c1408e198", "doc_id": "hp_e5470b4e6fa8bc35", "type": "RELEASED_BY"}, {"text": "It was released on 7 November 2011 by Wichita Recordings in the UK, set back a week from the original release date, and 3 days earlier on 4 November 2011 by Wichita Recordings and Liberator Music in Australia.", "chunk_id": "145e5d0c1408e198", "doc_id": "hp_e5470b4e6fa8bc35", "type": "RELEASED_BY"}]</data>
