<edge source="Escapees' Medal" target="France">
  <data key="d5">["BESTOWED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Escapees' Medal is bestowed by the government of France.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Escapees' Medal (French: \"Médaille des Évadés\" ) is a military award bestowed by the government of France to individuals who were prisoners of war and who successfully escaped internment or died as a result of their escape attempt.", "chunk_id": "cd19157192f4048d", "doc_id": "hp_e60b5baaa105aa72", "type": "BESTOWED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e60b5baaa105aa72</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Escapees' Medal" target="prisoners of war">
  <data key="d5">["AWARDED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Escapees' Medal is awarded to prisoners of war who successfully escaped or died attempting to escape.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Escapees' Medal (French: \"Médaille des Évadés\" ) is a military award bestowed by the government of France to individuals who were prisoners of war and who successfully escaped internment or died as a result of their escape attempt.", "chunk_id": "cd19157192f4048d", "doc_id": "hp_e60b5baaa105aa72", "type": "AWARDED_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e60b5baaa105aa72</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Escapees' Medal" target="First World War">
  <data key="d5">["HONORS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Escapees' Medal was intended to honor combatants of the First World War.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The \"Escapees' Medal\" was established by a 1926 law, intended to honour combatants not only of the First World War, but also of the Franco-Prussian War of 1870.", "chunk_id": "cd19157192f4048d", "doc_id": "hp_e60b5baaa105aa72", "type": "HONORS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e60b5baaa105aa72</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Escapees' Medal" target="Franco-Prussian War">
  <data key="d5">["HONORS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Escapees' Medal was intended to honor combatants of the Franco-Prussian War.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The \"Escapees' Medal\" was established by a 1926 law, intended to honour combatants not only of the First World War, but also of the Franco-Prussian War of 1870.", "chunk_id": "cd19157192f4048d", "doc_id": "hp_e60b5baaa105aa72", "type": "HONORS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e60b5baaa105aa72</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Escapees' Medal" target="Second World War">
  <data key="d5">["HONORS"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Combatants of the Second World War were later included in the statute for the Escapees' Medal.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Its statute was later amended to include combatants of the Second World War and later conflicts.", "chunk_id": "cd19157192f4048d", "doc_id": "hp_e60b5baaa105aa72", "type": "HONORS"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e60b5baaa105aa72</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Médaille des Évadés" target="Escapees' Medal">
  <data key="d5">["IS_TRANSLATION_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Médaille des Évadés is the French translation of the Escapees' Medal.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Escapees' Medal (French: \"Médaille des Évadés\" ) is a military award bestowed by the government of France to individuals who were prisoners of war and who successfully escaped internment or died as a result of their escape attempt.", "chunk_id": "cd19157192f4048d", "doc_id": "hp_e60b5baaa105aa72", "type": "IS_TRANSLATION_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e60b5baaa105aa72</data>
</edge>
