</edge>
<edge source="provost" target="Dean of Chelmsford">
  <data key="d5">["PREDECESSOR_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The post of provost was the designation before the post of Dean of Chelmsford.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Before 2000 the post was designated as a provost, which was then the equivalent of a dean at most English cathedrals.", "chunk_id": "147b3f29c0fcd687", "doc_id": "hp_e801334348d2b1fc", "type": "PREDECESSOR_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_e801334348d2b1fc</data>
</edge>
