  <data key="d6">Carl Prenzlow co-authored the paper 'Surface Areas from Mercury Porosimetry Measurements'.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The Rootare-Prenzlow Equation is named for Estonian-American scientist Hillar Rootare and American scientist Carl Prenzlow, first published in their 1967 paper, \"Surface Areas from Mercury Porosimetry Measurements,\" Rootare, H.M., and Prenzlow, C.F., 71 J. Phys. Chem. p. 2733 (1967).", "chunk_id": "0f6cd2c39ceebefb", "doc_id": "hp_ea52b11b7f3d5b7c", "type": "AUTHORED"}]</data>
