  <data key="d7">[{"text": "On 25 February 2013 it was announced that Florence and the Machine would be playing at the Coke Live Music Festival in Poland on 10 August 2013, and on 26 March 2013 it was announced that the band would be playing at Chime for Change's \"The Sound of Change Live\" concert at London's Twickenham Stadium alongside Beyoncé, Ellie Goulding and Haim, amongst others.", "chunk_id": "4a9a4f6f83f32605", "doc_id": "hp_ef31a7b23736d77e", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_ef31a7b23736d77e</data>
</edge>
