<edge source="Catan: Seafarers" target="The Settlers of Catan">
  <data key="d5">["EXPANSION_OF"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Catan: Seafarers is an expansion of the board game The Settlers of Catan.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Catan: Seafarers, or Seafarers of Catan in older editions, (German: \"Die Seefahrer von Catan\" ) is an expansion of the board game \"The Settlers of Catan\" for three to four players (five-to-six-player play is also possible with both of the respective five-to-six-player extensions).", "chunk_id": "4604dd9ff3227806", "doc_id": "hp_f44b12ff517dfad8", "type": "EXPANSION_OF"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_f44b12ff517dfad8</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Catan: Seafarers" target="ships">
  <data key="d5">["INCLUDES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Catan: Seafarers includes the addition of ships.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "The main feature of this expansion is the addition of ships, gold rivers, and the pirate to the game, allowing play between multiple islands.", "chunk_id": "4604dd9ff3227806", "doc_id": "hp_f44b12ff517dfad8", "type": "INCLUDES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_f44b12ff517dfad8</data>
</edge>
