<edge source="Jaime Fernández Reyes" target="Silver Ariel awards">
  <data key="d5">["WON"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Jaime Fernández Reyes won 3 Silver Ariel awards during his career.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Over his career, he won 3 Silver Ariel awards - the Mexican equivalent of the Oscar - including one for what is arguably his best-known role, playing Friday in Luis Buñuel's \"Robinson Crusoe\".", "chunk_id": "5caaa82e915cbb20", "doc_id": "hp_f4a1d9afa0828a54", "type": "WON"}]</data>
