<edge source="Retuertas horse" target="Doñana National Park">
  <data key="d5">["LOCATED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The Retuertas horse is now found in the Doñana National Park.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "It is now found only in the Doñana National Park in the provinces of Huelva and Sevilla, and in The Biological Reserve \"Campanarios de Azaba\" in Espeja (Salamanca province) a part of which is the research reserve of the Consejo Superior de Investigaciones Científicas, the Spanish National Research Council.", "chunk_id": "c416a15787294ca0", "doc_id": "hp_f5a05d2ab71d3e1b", "type": "LOCATED_IN"}]</data>
