  <data key="d6">Bothriochloa ischaemum var. songarica is an invasive weed in Texas.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Var. \"songarica\" is an invasive weed in Texas, where it is known as \"King Ranch bluestem\"; it has displaced native grasses in large areas of central and south Texas.", "chunk_id": "d4e8ac5bda630039", "doc_id": "hp_f7e1751d7e276925", "type": "IS_A_WEED_IN"}]</data>
